&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Please note, this is a talent pool advertisement, not a live role. If you would like to be considered for any future CRM Campaign Manager / Marketing Manager positions at DEPT®, please submit an application and we will be in touch when a suitable opportunity arises.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;JOB PURPOSE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are always on the lookout for new talent. Whether you&#39;re looking to kick-start your campaign management career, are a hands-on CRM specialist, or a seasoned Marketing Manager with campaign strategy and leadership experience, we would love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As part of our embedded inhouse model, you will be employed by DEPT® but embedded within our Client’s team. From your day-to-day responsibilities, collaborations and deliverables, you’ll operate directly within the client team, allowing for the best of both worlds: the close-knit feel and impact of working inhouse, alongside access to the benefits, opportunities and support that DEPT® offers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will bridge the gap between marketing strategy, end-to-end multichannel campaign delivery, and AI innovation. Sitting at the intersection of campaign strategy, CRM execution, marketing technology, and creative production, you will be responsible for how the client presents itself to customers across owned channels (email, push, onsite, in-app, landing pages). Depending on your level, you will manage campaign plans, build and QA CRM workflows, optimise cross-channel engagement, and leverage cutting-edge AI tools to scale personalisation and elevate performance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU’LL DO&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate business propositions and consumer insights into inspiring, end-to-end multi-channel campaign plans across owned channels (onsite, web, app, email, push).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage, build, and deploy CRM campaigns from briefing and creative development to QA, execution, and post-campaign analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Actively explore and apply AI tools and prompt workflows to accelerate content generation, creative ideation, dynamic personalisation, and campaign testing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead creative asset development across channels, ensuring brand consistency, high-quality execution, and rapid iteration for A/B testing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Liaise with internal stakeholders and cross-functional teams to clarify questions, manage expectations, and maintain briefing deadlines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Optimise campaign personalisation, audience targeting, and segmentation to maximise engagement and commercial performance across customer segments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, test, and analyse A/B testing frameworks and real-time channel metrics to deliver actionable post-campaign insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Troubleshoot technical campaign setups (data accuracy, dynamic tags, targeting logic, link rendering) to ensure high-quality, on-time delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain an understanding ofClient brand, strategies, and customer segments to act as a trusted creative adviser and brand guardian.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure responsible AI usage across workflows, prioritising data privacy, output validation, and continuous process optimisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU BRING&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We&#39;re open to seeing different levels of experience across CRM, digital marketing, and campaign management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience delivering a broad range of multi-channel marketing communications, including email, push notifications, onsite banners, and in-app channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong interest or hands-on experience with AI tools (e.g. ChatGPT/GPTs, automation platforms, generative tools) and prompt workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of B2C marketing execution, dynamic content, customer segmentation, and campaign tracking logic.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extremely organised, with the ability to manage multiple projects, timelines, and priorities in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data-driven mindset with experience conducting campaign QA, performance optimisation, or post-campaign analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly motivated to learn, grow, and continuously improve processes through innovative tactics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Personable, approachable demenor and strong collaborator across global, matrixed teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and oral communication skills, with the ability to engage and present to stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Basic understanding of HTML/CSS for email template rendering and troubleshooting is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WE OFFER&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A flexible hybrid working policy to enjoy the best of both worlds (2-3 days from the Client office).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Early Finish Fridays, kickstart your weekend early with alternating early-finish Fridays.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;26 days paid holiday, plus UK Bank Holidays.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to dedicated mental health resources including enhanced sick pay scheme, employee assistance programme and trained Mental Health First Aiders.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company Pension Scheme.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to a Private Medical Insurance or Cash Plan scheme.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Season Ticket Loan, interest-free Season Ticket Loans to help spread the cost of travel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cycle to Work Scheme, save money on a new bike and equipment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;EV Car Scheme, access to an electric vehicle via a salary sacrifice arrangement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enhanced family-friendly policies to support parents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Workplace Nursery Scheme, save on childcare by paying for nursery fees through a tax-efficient salary sacrifice scheme.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;DEPT® Allowance, a dedicated company contribution to spend on either your professional development or personal wellbeing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Social and Cultural Events, plenty of opportunities to connect with colleagues through organised activities and celebrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learning and Development, continuous growth opportunities through internal training, and &quot;inspirational talks” guest speakers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Buddy Program, you will be paired with a ‘Buddy’ to help you navigate your first weeks’ at DEPT®.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A Certified BCorp Agency and is multi-award winning “Agency of the Year”.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Awesome clients. Whether big or small, local or global, at DEPT® you’ll get the opportunity to work with clients of all sizes and across all industries. And we celebrate all of our successes together!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Global &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.deptagency.com/dept-cares-day-2023/&quot;&gt;DEPT® Cares Month&lt;/a&gt;, an annual initiative where our teams donate their professional skills and time to support local charities and pr-bono projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHY DEPT®?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are a Growth Invention company built to help the world’s most ambitious brands grow faster. Operating at the intersection of technology and marketing, we create what is next by pioneering ideas, acting fast, and moving further because standing still just is not in our DNA.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are drawn to people who stay curious, move with intent, and never stop inventing. Our culture runs on three values: better together, relentlessly curious, and get sh*t done. It is how we work, how we grow, and how we make things that matter.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At DEPT®, you will find the freedom to explore, the space to collaborate, and the trust to make a real impact for our clients, for each other, and for the world we are helping to build.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DIVERSITY, EQUITY &amp;amp; INCLUSION&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At DEPT®, we take pride in creating an inclusive workplace where everyone has an equal opportunity to thrive. We actively seek to recruit, develop, nurture, and retain talented individuals from diverse backgrounds, with varying skills and perspectives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Not sure you meet all qualifications? Apply, and let us decide! Research shows that women and members of underrepresented groups tend not to apply for jobs when they think they may not meet every requirement, when in fact they do. We believe in giving everyone a fair chance to shine.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We also encourage you to reach out to us and discuss any reasonable adjustments we can make to support you throughout the recruitment process and your time with us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Want to know more about our dedication to diversity, equity, and inclusion? Check out our efforts &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.deptagency.com/the-good-company/&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Allow us to introduce ourselves&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hello there! We’re Appinio, a global market research company that combines an AI-powered insights platform with expert consultancy. On a mission to make the world a little more fact-based, we help companies understand how consumers think and make smarter decisions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We started out in Hamburg back in 2014, but we’re now humbled to call the world our playground, with over &lt;strong&gt;260 employees&lt;/strong&gt; spread across &lt;strong&gt;13 countries &lt;/strong&gt;(we’re remote-first), 2600+ international clients, delivering research from &lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;+190 markets,&lt;/strong&gt; globally.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Want to be a part of the Appinio movement? &lt;strong&gt;🚀&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-preserver-spaces=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Here at Appinio, we value &lt;strong&gt;transparency&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;in our recruitment process&lt;/strong&gt;, and we&#39;ve created a blog to share what to expect during each step of our journey together:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-preserver-spaces=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-preserver-spaces=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link c-link--focus-visible&quot; href=&quot;https://www.appinio.com/en/blog/life-at-appinio/appinio-recruitment-process&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.appinio.com/en/blog/life-at-appinio/appinio-recruitment-process&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your mission as a Senior Research Consultant&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Research Consultant (m/f/d) &lt;/strong&gt;with a strong quantitative market research background to join our newly dedicated B2B research team in the DACH region. This specialized unit focuses on research projects that specifically survey B2B target groups, professional decision-makers, and niche business audiences (rather than only only standard B2C consumer panels), serving fast-moving consultancy clients and corporate B2B requests.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you will lead complex quantitative B2B research projects end-to-end, from initial feasibility alignment and study design to reporting and insight presentation. You will act as a senior sparring partner for corporate strategy leads and consultancy teams, translating intricate B2B &amp;amp; B2C data into clear, decision-ready recommendations. You will thrive in a high-velocity environment where speed, rigorous B2B screening logic, strong client presence, and operational precision are essential.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll be doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;End-to-End B2B Project Lead: Manage quantitative research projects end-to-end, including B2B screening design, questionnaire drafting, platform setup, fieldwork monitoring, and data delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Methodology &amp;amp; Study Design: Optimise bespoke study designs across core use cases (e.g., Target Group Analysis, U&amp;amp;A, Pricing studies, Concept Testing) mainly tailored to hard-to-reach professional audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Senior Client Sparring &amp;amp; Advisory: Act as a trusted partner for fast-paced consultancy and corporate clients, advising on sample feasibility, survey logic, and optimal research approaches under tight deadlines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commercial &amp;amp; Scoping Collaboration: Partner closely with Sales and Account Management on project scoping, feasibility checks, and methodology definition for complex project requests.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Process &amp;amp; Quality Enhancement: Contribute to standardizing B2B screening protocols, sampling frameworks, and best practices to coach other researcher and safeguard delivery speed and research quality across the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will thrive in this role if&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have &lt;strong&gt;5+ years of experience in quantitative market research with a distinct focus on surveying B2B target groups&lt;/strong&gt; and professional decision-makers (agency or consulting background required; pure academic or non-client backgrounds will not fit this role).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have hands-on experience designing studies, writing questionnaires, and executing quantitative projects across core B2B use cases (e.g., U&amp;amp;A, Pricing studies, Concept Testing, Target Group Analysis).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You bring proven experience creating executive-ready reports and presenting complex data through clear, compelling storytelling to senior client-side stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You possess a strategic, commercially minded approach with the self-confidence to guide clients and defend research decisions under pressure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You excel in high-velocity environments, with a demonstrated ability to juggle multiple concurrent projects, prioritize effectively, and stay calm under tight deadlines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are proficient in German (C2 level required) and English, with outstanding written and verbal communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You bring a pragmatic, proactive, and resilient mindset with a passion for data quality and innovation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What’s in it for you?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-preserver-spaces=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Flexibility&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-preserver-spaces=&quot;true&quot;&gt; Policy&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-preserver-spaces=&quot;true&quot;&gt; - Our flexibility policy means there is no hard cap on the number of vacation days you can take&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-preserver-spaces=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Temporary work from abroad - &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-preserver-spaces=&quot;true&quot;&gt;If you&#39;re based in the EU, you can work outside your country of residence for up to 180 days per year&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-preserver-spaces=&quot;true&quot;&gt;All the hardware you need and&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-preserver-spaces=&quot;true&quot;&gt;your own MacBook&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-preserver-spaces=&quot;true&quot;&gt;If you are located in Hamburg or Berlin, you&#39;ll get a&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-preserver-spaces=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Deutschland ticket&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-preserver-spaces=&quot;true&quot;&gt; or access to a mobility budget with the&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-preserver-spaces=&quot;true&quot;&gt;NAVIT app&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-preserver-spaces=&quot;true&quot;&gt; to get you to and from the office space&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Subsidised &lt;strong&gt;Urban Sports Club &lt;/strong&gt;or &lt;strong&gt;ClassPass&lt;/strong&gt; membership based on location&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-preserver-spaces=&quot;true&quot;&gt;In case&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-preserver-spaces=&quot;true&quot;&gt; you’re located in one of the cities where most of our fellow Appinioneers are (Hamburg, Berlin, Munich, London, Madrid, Barcelona, or New York), you can get access to our&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-preserver-spaces=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Co-working spaces&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;job-ad-editable job-ad-editable job-ad-editor&quot; data-content=&quot;6454846&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;role&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;job-ad-editable job-ad-editable job-ad-editor&quot; data-content=&quot;6454830&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Kind reminder:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Please ensure that your application is submitted in English.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;This post not only outlines our ideal candidate but also serves as an inspiration for what this role can evolve into. Even if you consider yourself an 80% fit but have a genuine passion for this position, we encourage you to apply. We&#39;re eager to hear from individuals who share our enthusiasm.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Appinio is an equal-opportunity employer. All applicants will be considered for employment without attention to race, colour, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, veteran, or disability status.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please read our privacy policy &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.appinio.com/en-gb/privacy&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
