&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Summary and Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;WPP is the creative transformation company. We use the power of creativity to build better futures for our people, planet, clients and communities. For more information, visit wpp.com.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;WPP Media is WPP’s global media collective. In a world where media is everywhere and in everything, we bring the best platform, people, and partners together to create limitless opportunities for growth. For more information, visit wppmedia.com.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Transition Operations Director&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is seeking a strategic and experienced Director, Transition Lead to join our team in London. This is a business-critical leadership role, responsible for orchestrating the seamless and successful onboarding of new clients and setting the stage for long-term growth and partnership.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the Transition Lead, you will own the end-to-end integration of complex, multi-market clients into our network. You will develop and execute robust transition programs, ensuring that all workstreams—from commercial setup to team onboarding and technology integration—are managed flawlessly. This is a unique opportunity to shape our agency&#39;s most important new client relationships from day one, ensuring we deliver operational excellence and drive immediate value. This role requires a leader who can navigate a matrixed environment, manage senior stakeholders, and drive change effectively. As part of the role, you&#39;ll at times also work across the wider WPP network, including partners in WPP Production and WPP Creative, to deliver integrated solutions. You will be responsible for leading teams in varying compositions based on the task at hand.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Transition Strategy &amp;amp; Programme Leadership: Develop and own the end-to-end transition strategy and detailed programme plans for new clients, defining scope, timelines, milestones, and key deliverables.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Execution &amp;amp; Coordination: Lead the flawless execution of the transition plan, coordinating across multiple markets and internal functions including client leadership, finance, legal, HR, and technology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Senior Stakeholder Management: Serve as the primary, senior point of contact for client executives and internal leadership throughout the transition, ensuring clear, consistent communication and expertly managing expectations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Change Management: Design and implement effective change management strategies to ensure the smooth adoption of new processes, tools, and team structures for both the client and our internal teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Risk &amp;amp; Issue Management: Proactively identify, assess, and mitigate risks associated with client transitions, developing contingency plans to ensure a smooth and professional onboarding experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Team Leadership: Build, manage, and mentor a high-performing transition team, fostering a culture of excellence, collaboration, and accountability. Leadership in a matrix environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills and Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An extensive and proven track record in a senior transition, programme management, or project management role, gained within a large-scale media agency, consultancy, or other complex, global organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrable success in leading complex, multi-market transitions for large, global clients or leading complex multi-market projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep expertise in applying project, programme, and change management methodologies (e.g., PMP, PRINCE2) to deliver successful business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional senior stakeholder management and communication skills, with a proven ability to influence and build consensus with executive-level leaders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong commercial and financial acumen, with experience managing complex project budgets and ensuring profitability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Inspirational leadership skills with experience building and developing high-performing teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strategic and commercially-minded approach, with the ability to navigate ambiguity and solve complex problems with clarity and confidence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with leveraging AI tools and AI-powered support for project management and project management tracking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Preferred Qualifications:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Significant prior experience within an agency group active in multi-market environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at WPP Media &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our passion for shaping the next era of media is powered by our commitment to&amp;nbsp;Be Extraordinary, investing in our employees to inspire transformational creativity. We also&amp;nbsp;Lead Optimistically,&amp;nbsp;firmly believing&amp;nbsp;in and&amp;nbsp;Championing Growth and Development&amp;nbsp;for every individual. This commitment allows WPP Media employees to&amp;nbsp;leverage&amp;nbsp;the extensive global WPP Media &amp;amp; WPP networks to pursue their passions, build vital professional connections, and learn at the&amp;nbsp;cutting edge&amp;nbsp;of marketing and advertising.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&amp;nbsp;Create an Open environment&amp;nbsp;built on trust and respect, where everyone feels they belong and has opportunities to progress. This inclusive culture is fostered through a variety of employee resource groups and frequent in-office events&amp;nbsp;showcasing&amp;nbsp;team wins, sharing thought leadership, and celebrating holidays and milestone events. Our comprehensive benefits package reflects this commitment, including competitive medical, group retirement plans, vision, and dental insurance, significant paid time off, preferential partner discounts, and employee mental health awareness days.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to characteristics. We believe the best work happens when&amp;nbsp;we&#39;re&amp;nbsp;together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection in this open and supportive environment.&amp;nbsp;That&#39;s&amp;nbsp;why&amp;nbsp;we’ve&amp;nbsp;adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you&amp;nbsp;require&amp;nbsp;accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&amp;nbsp; Please note that while our philosophy is the same across WPP, benefits may vary by office/country.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Please note this is a UK based role and requires individuals to have the right to work in this location&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please read our Privacy Notice (&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy)&lt;/a&gt; for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;While we appreciate all applications received, only those candidates selected for an interview will be contacted.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Promoted&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;Please read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy#:~:text=WPP%20Media%20Privacy%20Notice%20for%20Recruitment&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3007 - SVP, Data Solutions, UK&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Summary and Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the SVP Data Solutions Lead, you’ll own the development and delivery of a critical new capability that enables WPP Media clients to mobilise and unlock value from their first party data in media. Sitting within the UK Data Tech &amp;amp; Analytics team, you’ll be accountable for the delivery of Data Solutions including Private data network and Open intelligence itself in the UK and work as part of a cross WPP Media group spanning DTA, Partnerships, Investment, and our Technology Solutions teams to bring this to market and onboard clients. You will serve as the face of the Data solutions to internal teams and represent the capability in client sales engagements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the design the delivery and roadmap for Open intelligence in the UK, managing across stakeholder groups in DTA/MMD/DTS and leadership to represent UK solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Program lead the development of the Private data network and Open intelligence solutions across the UK and into global product teams to ensure UK requirements are being prioritized in the roadmap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and socalise the strategy for data solutions and open intelligence alongside Data Partnerships on the priority, roadmap and onboarding cadence of new data partners. Represent the solutions and WPP Media requirements in new partners discussions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish commercial bundling opportunities for partners and clients with WPP owned/bought/licensed data opportunities across the martech landscape.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Investment and Media Solutions teams to define the commercial model for Open intelligence/PDN business and GTM for Practices and Media Solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Data Strategy to create compelling marketing and training materials for PDN and Oi, socialize to client leadership community and upskill the data strategy community&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support early-stage new business pitches, among agency leadership, and in client-facing meetings to represent our data solutions in the UK.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure clear product marketing communications to internal stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish governance and guardrails for data solutions capabilities across media solutions, practices and commercial viability across all data solutions and touchpoints.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish the UK enablement strategy into clients with collaboration with the broader global and local product and solutions teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills and Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years experience in data strategy, data partnerships, proprietary media within a media agency or related company (e.g. publisher, ad tech, client marketing org)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong client direct experience in value proposition and client benefit narratives, with the ability to create contextual client benefit for WPP Media.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be the voice of clients for data solutions in the UK and how our local market nuances are represented and delivered through our WPP Open platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing and developing monetized data solutions in media.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of UK data partner landscape, data monetization models, proprietary media products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience helping set clear strategy, roadmapping, operationalizing solutions &amp;amp; organizing resources to deliver&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communications style, in particular being able to translate non-technical use cases into technical requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong influencing skills, able to represent and defend your data solutions with senior clients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An ability to collaborate in cross-functional teams, and directly influence others to drive adoption of solutions and overcome upstream barriers to implementation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear documentation and working playbooks on how and what is PDN is currently able to support and operationalize&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Delivery focused, solutions leader with a strong technical and client leadership background that can make commercial decisions with business context at the core.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at WPP Media &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our passion for shaping the next era of media is powered by our commitment to&amp;nbsp;Be Extraordinary, investing in our employees to inspire transformational creativity. We also&amp;nbsp;Lead Optimistically,&amp;nbsp;firmly believing&amp;nbsp;in and&amp;nbsp;Championing Growth and Development&amp;nbsp;for every individual. This commitment allows WPP Media employees to&amp;nbsp;leverage&amp;nbsp;the extensive global WPP Media &amp;amp; WPP networks to pursue their passions, build vital professional connections, and learn at the&amp;nbsp;cutting edge&amp;nbsp;of marketing and advertising.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&amp;nbsp;Create an Open environment&amp;nbsp;built on trust and respect, where everyone feels they belong and has opportunities to progress. This inclusive culture is fostered through a variety of employee resource groups and frequent in-office events&amp;nbsp;showcasing&amp;nbsp;team wins, sharing thought leadership, and celebrating holidays and milestone events. Our comprehensive benefits package reflects this commitment, including competitive medical, group retirement plans, vision, and dental insurance, significant paid time off, preferential partner discounts, and employee mental health awareness days.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to characteristics. We believe the best work happens when&amp;nbsp;we&#39;re&amp;nbsp;together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection in this open and supportive environment.&amp;nbsp;That&#39;s&amp;nbsp;why&amp;nbsp;we’ve&amp;nbsp;adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you&amp;nbsp;require&amp;nbsp;accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&amp;nbsp; Please note that while our philosophy is the same across WPP, benefits may vary by office/country.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Please note this is a UK based role and requires individuals to have the right to work in this location&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please read our Privacy Notice (&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy)&lt;/a&gt; for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;While we appreciate all applications received, only those candidates selected for an interview will be contacted.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Promoted&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;Please read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy#:~:text=WPP%20Media%20Privacy%20Notice%20for%20Recruitment&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Director, Solutions Development – Performance Development&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the creative transformation company. We use the power of creativity to build better futures for our people, planet, clients and communities. For more information, visit wpp.com.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP’s global media collective. In a world where media is everywhere and in everything, we bring the best platform, people, and partners together to create limitless opportunities for growth. For more information, visit wppmedia.com&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At WPP Media, we believe in the power of our culture and our people. It’s what elevates us to deliver exceptional experiences for both our clients and each other. In this role it will be critical to embrace WPP &amp;amp; WPP Media’s shared core values:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Extraordinary&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;by&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;Leading Collectively&lt;/em&gt;&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;Inspire transformational Creativity.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create an&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Open&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;environment by&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;Balancing People and Client Experiences&lt;/em&gt;&amp;nbsp;by&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;Cultivating Trust&lt;/em&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Optimistically&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;by&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;Championing Growth&lt;/em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;and Development&lt;/em&gt;&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;Mobilize the Enterprise&lt;/em&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Summary and Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As one of our Directors in the Solutions Development team you will be focused specifically on leading the design and development for enhanced digital performance within WPP Media Solutions in ways that have client appeal and are revenue returning.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With either extensive performance marketing, or in-platform performance experience in social and programmatic, you will canvas the broad responsibility of leading strategically on designing the destination and mapping the requirements, with tactical development planning to ensure we build, test, and launch with robust processes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strategically, you will act as a forward-looking leader and innovation agent, shaping the future of performance within WPP Media Solutions and directly influencing our own path to delivering Guaranteed Outcomes to clients.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tactically, you will both lead cross-functional working groups to build, test and launch while also collaborating with marketing science, directly feeding into the rest of the portfolio – defining, evolving and championing lower funnel performance delivery for clients in line with our gold standard measurement and effectiveness framework.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The role promises to offer you a platform for individual growth, matrix management of cross-functional teams across Data &amp;amp; Tech, Solutions Integrations, Marketing Science, Planning, and Activation with a platform for true client and business impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Overall Purpose:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To lead, shape, and directly influence our lower funnel performance offer to clients – grounded in social and OR programmatic, with influence into the wider portfolio.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibility set&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Performance planning &amp;amp; Solution design:&lt;/strong&gt;Define and lead the development of best-in-market performance capabilities for Social (P1) and ideally Programmatic Display (P2), ensuring solutions are synced to client needs and cross-channel use cases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic &amp;amp; Thought leader:&lt;/strong&gt;Be the go-to expert for innovation and developments in Performance delivery for clients with a lens on Social and Programmatic Display, understanding competitive landscapes, and collaboratively shaping solution differentiation. Lead channel innovation leveraging our Desirability, Feasibility, Viability framework.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional leadership:&lt;/strong&gt;Lead cross-functional working groups, bringing together diverse teams (media, tech, marketing science, planning, activation) to deliver prioritized developments and planned benefits. This involves being a project manager for complex initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior stakeholder engagement:&lt;/strong&gt;Engage confidently with senior leaders and stakeholders to drive ideas, influence strategy, and articulate the value of proposed solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Channel ecosystem understanding:&lt;/strong&gt;Network with agency practitioners and EMEA colleagues to ensure a finely tuned understanding of how channels are planned, activated, and measured, driving solution consistency and identifying opportunities for share and reapply.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commercial &amp;amp; compliance oversight:&lt;/strong&gt;Ensure the compliant design and development of owned channel solutions, continuously reviewing pricing, margin setting, and market fit. Maintain a deep understanding of the supply chain and cost model.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Roadmap &amp;amp; delivery:&lt;/strong&gt;Develop and deliver a channel roadmap, manage solution materials, and troubleshoot business challenges to ensure an enhanced and integrated portfolio of solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills and Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years with performance marketing experience in Media, with proof points in Performance, Social and OR Programmatic trading.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evidenced experience and understanding of Digital Media, both from a media and technical perspective with strong relationships with adtech/martech partners to enable solution development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Performance Marketing craft knowledge and industry POV is important.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An entrepreneurial attitude with a portfolio of experiences to showcase ability to recognise and develop new client solutions ahead of market maturity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Accredited or can speak to project management experience to effectively manage cross-functional teams and associated developments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confidence and Ability to manage and deliver multiple projects to multiple deadlines simultaneously&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Life at WPP Media &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our passion for shaping the next era of media includes investing in our employees to help them do their best work, and we’re just as committed to employee growth as we are to responsible media investment. WPP Media employees can tap into the global WPP Media &amp;amp; WPP networks to pursue their passions, grow their networks, and learn at the cutting edge of marketing and advertising. We have a variety of employee resource groups and host frequent in-office events showcasing team wins, sharing thought leadership, and celebrating holidays and milestone events. Our benefits include competitive medical, group retirement plans, vision, and dental insurance, significant paid time off, preferential partner discounts, and employee mental health awareness days.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to characteristics. We are committed to fostering a culture of respect in which everyone feels they belong and has the same opportunities to progress in their careers.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection. That&#39;s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please read our Privacy Notice (&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy)&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#Li-Promoted&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;Please read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy#:~:text=WPP%20Media%20Privacy%20Notice%20for%20Recruitment&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Role Summary and Impact&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;This role is within The Goat Agency&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;, a leading brand within WPP Media, where you will be instrumental in&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW64445132 BCX4&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW64445132 BCX4&quot;&gt;helping global brands harness the power of social and creator-led content to deliver measurable impact. Recognised as a global leader in the space, we deliver award-winning campaigns in more than 70 countries. With over 650 social natives worldwide, we create ambitious influencer programmes from tactical activations to long-term partnerships, designed to drive awareness,&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW64445132 BCX4&quot;&gt;engagement&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW64445132 BCX4&quot;&gt;and conversions across the full marketing funnel.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW64445132 BCX4&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW64445132 BCX4&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW9121248 BCX4&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW9121248 BCX4&quot;&gt;Skills and Experience&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP Selected SCXW9121248 BCX4&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW64445132 BCX4&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP Selected SCXW9121248 BCX4&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;We are seeking a c&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;reative and motivated Senior Video Editor &amp;amp; Motion Designer to join our in-house production team. You will be in a key creative and technical role within the Campaigns team, responsible for editing and assembling video content specifically for client campaigns. This role focuses on transforming raw footage and assets into compelling, high-quality video deliverables that align with client briefs, campaign objectives, and brand guidelines.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW64445132 BCX4&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP Selected SCXW9121248 BCX4&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the end to end editing a variety of video content for client campaigns, including social media ads, case studies, promotional videos, and other campaign-specific assets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work from client briefs, storyboards, and producer direction to assemble footage, apply graphics, add music and sound effects, and ensure a high-quality final product.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure all video edits are technically sound, creatively engaging, and effectively communicate the campaign message.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adhere to client brand guidelines, campaign-specific style guides, and platform best practices (e.g., social media safe zones, aspect ratios).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform colour correction, sound mixing, and motion graphics to enhance video content.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage and organise video project files, footage, and assets efficiently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work quickly and efficiently to meet tight campaign deadlines without compromising quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with Producers, Campaign Managers, Strategists, Account Managers, and other relevant team members to ensure video content aligns seamlessly with overall campaign strategy and messaging.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Producers to review edits, incorporate feedback, and make revisions as required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare final video files for delivery in various formats according to client and platform specifications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay updated with the latest video editing techniques, software, and industry trends relevant to campaign content.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide creative input and suggestions during the editing process to enhance storytelling and visual impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Troubleshoot technical issues related to video editing software and workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be able to watch edits and point out areas where graphics, context, or snippets can be added with the ability to find and insert them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Creatively review an edit, providing a fresh outlook on content with the confidence to offer ideas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience as a Video Editor, with a strong portfolio showcasing expertise in editing video content for various social media platforms, ideally within a campaign or client-focused environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in professional video editing software (e.g., Adobe Premiere Pro, Adobe After Effects, Final Cut Pro, DaVinci Resolve).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of video formats, codecs, and best practices for online video delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent storytelling skills and a keen eye for visual composition, pacing, and rhythm.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work creatively within brand guidelines and client briefs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with colour correction, sound design, and bespoke motion graphics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Meticulous attention to detail and a commitment to delivering high-quality, polished video content.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to manage multiple editing projects simultaneously and meet tight campaign deadlines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good organisational and time-management skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work efficiently under pressure and adapt to feedback and revisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills and the ability to collaborate effectively with producers and other team members.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proactive approach to learning new skills and staying current with editing technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Life at WPP Media &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Our passion for shaping the next era of media is powered by our commitment to&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Be Extraordinary, investing in our employees to inspire transformational creativity. We also&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Lead Optimistically, firmly believing in and&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Championing Growth and Development&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;for every individual. This commitment allows WPP Media employees to leverage the extensive global WPP Media &amp;amp; WPP networks to pursue their passions, build vital professional connections, and learn at the cutting edge of marketing and advertising.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;We&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Create an Open environment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;built on trust and respect, where everyone feels they belong and has opportunities to progress. This inclusive culture is fostered through a variety of employee resource groups and frequent in-office events showcasing team wins, sharing thought leadership, and celebrating holidays and milestone events. Our comprehensive benefits package reflects this commitment, including competitive medical, group retirement plans, vision, and dental insurance, significant paid time off, preferential partner discounts, and employee mental health awareness days.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;WPP Media is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to characteristics. We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection in this open and supportive environment. That&#39;s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;  Please note that while our philosophy is the same across WPP, benefits may vary by office/country.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Please note this is a UK based role and requires individuals to have the right to work in this location&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Please read our Privacy Notice (&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;While we appreciate all applications received, only those candidates selected for an interview will be contacted.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;#LI-Promoted&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW64445132 BCX4&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP Selected SCXW9121248 BCX4&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;Please read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy#:~:text=WPP%20Media%20Privacy%20Notice%20for%20Recruitment&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Job Title:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; Senior Account Executive – SEO Content &amp;amp; Digital PR Strategy&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Location:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; WPP London -&amp;nbsp;One, 1 Southwark&amp;nbsp;Brg, Southwark Bridge Rd, London SE1 9HL&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Reporting to:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; Head of Performance Content&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;About the Role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Are you a digital marketer with a passion for search, content, and creative strategy? Are you excited by how AI is changing the way people discover brands online?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We are looking for an ambitious Senior Account Executive  to join our SEO Performance Content Team.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;In this role, you will work closely with the Head of Performance Content to deliver organic search growth and authority. You will work across a prestigious portfolio of household names (including a global FMCG giant and leading brands across nutrition, pet care, and consumer goods) as well as supporting on other exciting client accounts.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;What makes this role unique?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; This role bridges the gap between technical search optimisation and creative brand building. In our team, Digital PR is highly strategic and built entirely on SEO data to drive organic authority. Rather than running transactional media outreach and pitching journalists yourself, your focus will be on the strategic end-to-end SEO process&amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;from content&amp;nbsp;roadmapping&amp;nbsp;and copywriting to conceptualising link-earning campaigns.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;SEO Content &amp;amp; Creation (approx. 70%)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;6&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;End-to-End Content Delivery: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Support and work across the entire content lifecycle&amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;from&amp;nbsp;initial&amp;nbsp;search data analysis and building out content strategy plans/roadmaps, to preparing briefs and writing copy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;6&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;2&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Copywriting &amp;amp; Creation: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Write and edit high-quality, engaging, and SEO-friendly copy (from short-form landing pages to long-form articles) that aligns with&amp;nbsp;clients’&amp;nbsp;brand guidelines.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;6&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;3&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;On-Page Optimisation: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Review and optimise on-page content to ensure it is structured effectively for both search engines and emerging AI-search formats.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;6&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;4&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Keyword &amp;amp; Trend Research: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Use SEO tools to uncover search trends, conduct keyword research, and&amp;nbsp;identify&amp;nbsp;content gaps.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Digital PR &amp;amp; Link Strategy Support (approx. 30%)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;7&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Creative Campaign Support&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;: Participate&amp;nbsp;in brainstorms to help develop creative, link-earning Digital PR ideas designed to boost brand authority.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;7&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;2&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Agency Coordination: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Assist&amp;nbsp;in briefing and coordinating with WPP partner agencies and external PR teams to ensure our search&amp;nbsp;objectives&amp;nbsp;are aligned.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;7&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;3&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Backlink &amp;amp; Competitor Monitoring: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Monitor client and competitor backlink profiles to&amp;nbsp;identify&amp;nbsp;fresh link-acquisition opportunities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;7&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;4&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;AI &amp;amp; Search Tracking: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Help the team track how the search landscape is evolving, keeping an eye on AI search developments.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Account Coordination &amp;amp; Reporting&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;8&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Day-to-Day Support: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Help manage timelines, deliverables, and communication between our team,&amp;nbsp;client&amp;nbsp;contacts, and external partners.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;8&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;2&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Reporting: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Assist&amp;nbsp;in gathering data and compiling performance reports to&amp;nbsp;demonstrate&amp;nbsp;organic search and backlink growth.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
