&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3528 - Director, Programmatic, Global Client Solutions&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Summary and Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;This is a senior role that requires delivery of best-in-class global Programmatic marketing strategic direction, and best practice on the ground media solutions for key global clients. Our clients are embarking on a socially rich, insight-fuelled approach to global media strategy, and this role is designed to bring expertise in how to tap into culture and communities through Programmatic avenues, and how that fits into the wider media mix. Additionally, the role is expected to drive best practice planning and activation frameworks to elevate all global delivery.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will work to drive digital acceleration and bigger picture digital leadership. Acting as an aspirational figurehead this leader will be responsible for the development of our Programmatic and Open-web offering, providing leadership internally and collaborating closely with WPP Media services. You will work alongside other Digital and Channel Business Directors, Client Strategy teams, along with other agency teams (ie. Analytics, Business Planning, Insights).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Role Responsibilities&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Acting as a thought a thought leader, developing programmatic strategy and innovative solutions to position WPP Media as industry leaders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working with key markets to develop new test and learn opportunities – collating results and scaling those to drive further growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identifying opportunities for expanding our expertise, by understanding the needs of our clients and the direction of the industry.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Acting as go-to expert on key industry topics (within your field of expertise), able to create points of view in line with our business values.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continued development of our client’s key partnerships with DSPs and valued premium inventory partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A key day to day contact for senior clients, you will be the go-to for all Programmatic platform and utilisation queries&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensuring we stay market-leading in the programmatic media space, with development of case studies and thought leadership articles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Representing WPP Media in new business pitches, contributes to pricing structures and attending sales meetings when needed to actively contribute to product and business strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maximising internal knowledge-sharing, aligning goals with the direction of the wider company to capitalise on competitive advantages&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Building relationships and strong ways of working with all key market local social specialists to enable better global to local collaboration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Investigate and develop POVs on emerging platform capabilities, formats, and general industry developments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills and Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At WPP Media, we believe in the power of our culture and our people. It’s what elevates us to deliver exceptional experiences for both our clients and each other. In this role it will be critical to embrace WPP &amp;amp; WPP Media’s shared core values:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be &lt;strong&gt;Extraordinary&lt;/strong&gt; by &lt;em&gt;Leading Collectively&lt;/em&gt; to &lt;em&gt;Inspire transformational Creativity.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create an &lt;strong&gt;Open&lt;/strong&gt; environment by&lt;em&gt; Balancing People and Client Experiences&lt;/em&gt; by &lt;em&gt;Cultivating Trust&lt;/em&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead &lt;strong&gt;Optimistically&lt;/strong&gt; by &lt;em&gt;Championing Growth&lt;/em&gt; &lt;em&gt;and Development&lt;/em&gt; to &lt;em&gt;Mobilize the Enterprise&lt;/em&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven programmatic planning &amp;amp; buying experience, particularly across large spending clients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Established thought-leadership in the Programmatic Marketing &amp;amp; Media industry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in working directly with Google, TTD, Amazon, Adlook, Blis and other DSP partners to drive best practice and development of product&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with a large network&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to develop platform best practice and process documentation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear views on programmatic display, video and Open-web as part of the wider marketing mix&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent verbal and written communications skills, being able to confidently and clearly present work to clients, media owners and internal stakeholders. Experience &amp;amp; gravitas to ‘fly solo’ &amp;amp; present to mid to senior weight clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High level numeracy and analysis skills, to be able to interrogate data and coming out with actionable insights to inform business decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to thrive and work independently in an incredibly fast-paced, dynamic environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent troubleshooting skills: ability to quickly and creatively solve issues (both technical and operational)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to communicate process driven approaches clearly and effectively to non-technical individuals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record delivering high quality results in a fast-paced, deadline-driven environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven success in stakeholder management and ability to build relationships with clients and partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven commercial success of driving business growth and creating new revenue streams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record in performance media (including e-commerce) and good understanding of the wider media mix&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong project management and resource allocation skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leadership, collaboration, facilitation, and negotiation skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proactive, “can do” attitude. Self-starter and motivator with the ability to work in an autonomous fast paced environment doing what is necessary to deliver with speed, agility and forward-thinking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to achieve high quality results by paying attention to detail. Team Player and willing to help with any task thrown at them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at WPP Media &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our passion for shaping the next era of media includes investing in our employees to help them do their best work, and we’re just as committed to employee growth as we are to responsible media investment. WPP Media employees can tap into the global WPP Media &amp;amp; WPP networks to pursue their passions, grow their networks, and learn at the cutting edge of marketing and advertising. We have a variety of employee resource groups and host frequent in-office events showcasing team wins, sharing thought leadership, and celebrating holidays and milestone events. Our benefits include competitive medical, group retirement plans, vision, and dental insurance, significant paid time off, preferential partner discounts, and employee mental health awareness days.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to particular characteristics. We are committed to fostering a culture of respect in which everyone feels they belong and has the same opportunities to progress in their careers.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection. That&#39;s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Please note this is a UK based role and requires individuals to have the right to work in this location&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please read our Privacy Notice (&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy)&lt;/a&gt; for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Promoted&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;Please read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy#:~:text=WPP%20Media%20Privacy%20Notice%20for%20Recruitment&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Summary and Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Data, Tech &amp;amp; Analytics capability is on a mission to transform marketing by building the fastest, most connected data platform that bridges marketing strategy to scaled activation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We work with agencies and clients to transform the value of data by bringing together technology, data and analytics capabilities. We deliver this through the Open Media Studio, an AI-enabled media and data platform for the next era of advertising.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re endlessly curious. Our team of thinkers, builders, creators and problem solvers are over 1,000 strong, across 20 markets around the world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Director, Analytics&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The core purpose of DTA is to support global and multi-market clients. In turn, the Analytics team has a sharp focus and dedication to developing client relationships through data solutions, and by understanding how data and technology combine to inform analytics and insights to drive better decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The Analytics team are committed to building and delivering regular reporting and insight solutions for our clients, and to identify ways of utilizing emerging technologies and analytical techniques to drive growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The Analytics Director will work closely with the Head of Analytics, the Analytics team and wider client teams to manage and develop the ongoing delivery of relevant Reporting, Analytics, and Optimization solutions across WPP Media client requirements for Colgate Palmolive (CP).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Key to success will be the appropriate use of technology and identification of new opportunities and potential solutions – particularly focusing on how media effectiveness contributes to an overall measurement framework for CP.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The role will also require the ongoing management and development of Analytics team members where relevant – and the Analytics Director will help ensure the agency and our clients understand and appreciate the breadth of solutions the Analytics team can offer and the value we can add.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills and Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with CP to identify analytical requirements, solve challenges, and define and implement analysis roadmaps, acting as the primary analytics liaison for the agency and the client, providing CP stakeholders with actionable insights and recommendations through storytelling and visualization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Become an expert in CPs business, systems and ways of working. Be the point of contact for CPs GIT and GDO teams for new workstreams and data pipelines and proactively identify future solutions where necessary&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure Coordination and Collaboration across functions, markets and with the CP Client, working with Local Market Planning teams to develop, pilot, maintain and enhance a range of Business Intelligence projects ensuring outputs support measurement goals and drive business decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead digital transformation initiatives to modernize data collection, processing, and analytics infrastructure, ensuring data accuracy through clear processes, data governance principles and appropriate technology, and foster collaboration across internal teams (activation, channel teams, and account management), to integrate analytics into all aspects of client engagement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop templates, frameworks and automation processes for (primarily) Digital Data to enable a relevant, valuable and consistent understanding of media performance for CP. Drive forward pilot projects, testing and case studies and share learnings and best practice across all markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Other Responsibilities&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Become familiar with the existing Analytics toolset to utilize on client business, including data visualisation technologies (Power BI, Tableau, Datorama), reporting tools (Microsoft Excel, Looker Studio), data warehouse tools (Google BigQuery), measurement platforms (Google Campaign Manager and Google Analytics) and Effectiveness partners (both within WPP and externally)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop effective partnerships with key stakeholders within clients, WPP Media, WPP and other specialist companies to know exactly who to call on when required, and when to gain buy-in&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help evolve the Analytics offering in areas including Forecasting, Attribution, Machine learning and use of AI to improve processes and solve problems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help develop an open, collaborative, progressive day to day culture within Analytics, WPP Media clients – sharing best practice, and teaching and empowering agency and client end users to leverage BI tools and reach actionable insights&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure your direct reports are clear and confident on their goals &amp;amp; deliverables and are nurtured to fulfil their potential with regular development conversations, formal reviews and associated training plans, mentoring them to enhance technical expertise, analytical thinking, and client communication&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Required skills / experience:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience of working within a communications agency and/or client organisation – ideally International/multi market&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A problem solver with excellent senior client / stakeholder management &amp;amp; communication skills and attention to detail&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to get stuck in and make things happen, and the desire to define and implement creative new solutions to client problems - driving improvement and positive change&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at WPP Media &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our passion for shaping the next era of media is powered by our commitment to&amp;nbsp;Be Extraordinary, investing in our employees to inspire transformational creativity. We also&amp;nbsp;Lead Optimistically,&amp;nbsp;firmly believing&amp;nbsp;in and&amp;nbsp;Championing Growth and Development&amp;nbsp;for every individual. This commitment allows WPP Media employees to&amp;nbsp;leverage&amp;nbsp;the extensive global WPP Media &amp;amp; WPP networks to pursue their passions, build vital professional connections, and learn at the&amp;nbsp;cutting edge&amp;nbsp;of marketing and advertising.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&amp;nbsp;Create an Open environment&amp;nbsp;built on trust and respect, where everyone feels they belong and has opportunities to progress. This inclusive culture is fostered through a variety of employee resource groups and frequent in-office events&amp;nbsp;showcasing&amp;nbsp;team wins, sharing thought leadership, and celebrating holidays and milestone events. Our comprehensive benefits package reflects this commitment, including competitive medical, group retirement plans, vision, and dental insurance, significant paid time off, preferential partner discounts, and employee mental health awareness days.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to characteristics. We believe the best work happens when&amp;nbsp;we&#39;re&amp;nbsp;together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection in this open and supportive environment.&amp;nbsp;That&#39;s&amp;nbsp;why&amp;nbsp;we’ve&amp;nbsp;adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you&amp;nbsp;require&amp;nbsp;accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&amp;nbsp; Please note that while our philosophy is the same across WPP, benefits may vary by office/country.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Please note this is a UK based role and requires individuals to have the right to work in this location&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please read our Privacy Notice (&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy)&lt;/a&gt; for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;While we appreciate all applications received, only those candidates selected for an interview will be contacted.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Promoted&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;Please read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy#:~:text=WPP%20Media%20Privacy%20Notice%20for%20Recruitment&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2876 - Creative Producer &amp;amp; Videographer (Influencer Campaign Production) - UK&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Summary and Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Goat is WPP Media’s influencer solution, helping global brands harness the power of social and creator-led content to deliver measurable impact. Recognised as a global leader in the space, we deliver award-winning campaigns in more than 70 countries. With over 650 social natives worldwide, we create ambitious influencer programmes—from tactical activations to long-term partnerships—designed to drive awareness, engagement, and conversions across the full marketing funnel.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a midweight&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Creative Producer &amp;amp; Videographer&lt;/strong&gt;, you will act as a &quot;Swiss Army Knife&quot; within the Campaign Production Team, delivering high quality social content for our clients. You will be a versatile, hybrid specialist who seamlessly bridges the gap between creative ideation, logistical production, hands-on shooting, and editing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Designed for an ambitious content professional in their early career, this role is built for efficiency and creative agility. You will take end-to-end ownership of your projects, helping scale our output. You have a strong eye for videography, with ability to adapt the shooting style to suit client and project briefs. You are highly collaborative, commercially minded, and ready to jump into multiple areas of our fast-paced workflow to deliver high-quality, social-first content.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Expected Discipline &amp;amp; Allocation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shooting (50%):&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Leading the camera on self-produced projects and supporting larger-scale shoots.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Editing (40%):&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Cutting, grading, and delivering the content you shoot to deliver client-ready assets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Production (10%):&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Handling end-to-end logistics, scheduling, and prep for your independent projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;End-to-End Production &amp;amp; Autonomy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Project Ownership:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Manage mid-scale production projects from brief to final delivery, overseeing all elements of pre production and post production, supported by the Senior Campaign Production Manager.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Logistical Prep:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Coordinate basic production logistics, including scheduling, talent/influencer coordination, and equipment prep.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Workflow Integration:&lt;/strong&gt; Maintain high efficiency, ensuring your time is fully utilised and aligned with client-billable projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Social-First Shooting &amp;amp; Cinematography&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hands-on Videography:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Serve as the lead videographer on your own projects, capturing highly engaging, platform-native content optimised for TikTok, Reels, YouTube, and Shorts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborative Support:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Feed into larger agency shoots alongside senior producers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equipment Mastery:&lt;/strong&gt; Confidently operate a variety of camera, lighting, and audio packages suitable for agile, fast-paced environments. You will be responsible for the organisation and upkeep of our in house equipment store.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agile Post-Production &amp;amp; Editing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Self-Sufficient Editing:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Own the post-production phase of your shoots, translating raw footage into polished, compelling social cuts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Post Oversight:&lt;/strong&gt; Be able to delegate edits for your projects, briefing editors and reviewing their work, providing clear and concise feedback aligned with project goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team Support:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Deliver clean, organised project files, opening up capacity for the core post-production team to focus on heavy, complex agency workloads.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Platform Formatting:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Ensure all edits are optimised for various social aspect ratios, safe zones, and platform trends (including typography, hooks, and pacing).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills &amp;amp; Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience in video production, shooting, and editing, preferably within an agency, publisher, or social-first media brand. Freelance experience is also considered.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proven track record of acting as a &quot;one-person crew&quot;—capable of directing, shooting, and editing your own work under tight deadlines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with professional camera systems (Sony, Canon, or similar digital cinema systems) as well as mobile/gimbal setups.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of lighting design for simple interview and social content set ups.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong working knowledge of Adobe Premiere Pro (After Effects and DaVinci Resolve skills are a major plus).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A deep understanding of what makes content perform on social media platforms (TikTok, Reels, Shorts) and the ability to adapt creative formats accordingly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills with the ability to manage project stakeholders and collaborate across multi-disciplinary teams (Campaigns, Strategy, and Paid Media).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A calm, structured approach to managing multiple deliverables simultaneously in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
