&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;8,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Langages :&lt;/strong&gt; Python (Expertise requise), SQL.&lt;/p&gt;
