&lt;li&gt;Spread and improve our best practices to ensure algorithm implementations are user-friendly, well-documented, and thoroughly tested, including unit tests, comprehensive documentation, CI, and non-regression testing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Present results to key stakeholders and assist them in utilizing algorithms for client engagement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the client-facing projects to understand and shape the impact Beacon algorithms have for our customers, both for existing deployed algorithms, and future algorithm development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have more than 4 years of industry experience in machine learning and deep learning, particularly in health sciences or other regulated fields, with a proven track record of bringing algorithms into production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are experienced with digital signal processing (DSP) and statistics and care about using the right tool for the job, which in many cases might not be machine learning or deep learning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are proficient in using PyTorch (preferred) or other deep learning frameworks for training, developing, and deploying deep learning models.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are familiar with latest Deep Learning advances (Transformer/ViT, large scale modeling, large model training, ...)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You follow and adopt best practices in software and ML engineering, including testing, version control, code reviews, documentation, Dockerization, CI/CD, and experiment tracking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are familiar with biosignals, medical imaging data, or large time-series datasets, &amp;nbsp;or are enthusiastic about learning more in the domain.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You thrive in a team environment, recognizing that collaboration, open communication, and continuous feedback are essential for collective success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are able to distill, discuss, and present complex technical topics in a way that is appropriate for the audience at hand, both internally and externally.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are excited to participate in the entire algorithm development lifecycle, which spans scoping, data wrangling, algorithm development/experimentation, formal validation, quality/regulatory documentation, production deployment, and working with clients who might benefit from these algorithms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The base salary range for this role is determined based on past experience, specific skills and qualifications. The base salary is one component of the total compensation package, which includes equity, PTO and other benefits.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Beacon, we&#39;ve found that cultural and scientific impact is driven most by those that lead by example. As such, we&#39;re always seeking new contributors whose work demonstrates an avid curiosity, a bias towards simplicity, an eye for composability, a self-service mindset, and - most of all - a deep empathy towards colleagues, stakeholders, users, and patients. We believe a diverse team builds more robust systems and achieves higher impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Remote&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;At Jamf, we believe in an open, flexible culture based on respect and trust. Our track record and thriving work environment all stem from the freedom we grant ourselves to get the job done right. We take pride in helping tens of thousands of customers around the globe succeed with Apple.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The secret to our success lies in our connectivity, while operating with a high degree of flexibility. Work-life balance remains our priority while feeling connected is important to maintain our strong culture, achieve our goals, and thrive as #OneJamf.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do at Jamf:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Consulting Engineer&#39;s (CE) primary role is to partner within Sales and other departments to achieve sales and revenue goals, serving as technical authority and escalation resource for complex opportunities. This role blends deep Apple ecosystem expertise with advanced security knowledge across endpoint protection, identity management, and network security, enabling you to design and deliver integrated enterprise solutions that drive innovation and support our customers beyond traditional device management. You will collaborate closely with Sales, Product, and Marketing teams, as well as industry partners, to deliver secure, scalable, and innovative solutions for enterprise environments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This position is only available for employees located in The Netherlands, The United Kingdom, Germany or France. We are only able to accept applications for those based in The Netherlands, The United Kingdom, Germany or France and have sponsorship to live and work in The Netherlands, The United Kingdom, Germany or France #Li-Remote&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you can expect to do in this role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform all job responsibilities in alignment with the core values, mission and vision of the organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide technical consultation and technical escalation for Sales and other departments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as technical escalation resource for Sales Engineers on complex, strategic opportunities requiring advanced architecture expertise or executive engagement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuously update expertise and demonstrate deep understanding of subject matter specific to role assignment, including but not limited to:
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Architecture of Jamf&#39;s comprehensive platform solutions: Jamf for Mac, Jamf for Mobile, Jamf for K-12, and Jamf for Small Business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Architecture of Android device management and security solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Architecture of identity management solutions leveraging Platform SSO and enterprise directory integration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Architecture of enterprise security infrastructure (SIEM, SOAR, IAM platforms)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Architecture of Apple-centric zero-trust network frameworks such as Managed Device Attestation and WireGuard&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Architecture of cross-platform security frameworks for enterprise environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Architecture of Apple and Android-centric security frameworks for enterprise environments&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of common and emerging threat vectors and risks specific to Apple and Android enterprise environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Architecture of advanced Jamf configurations including automation frameworks and API integrations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Custom workflows and automation for large-scale enterprise deployments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead response to complex RFPs requiring comprehensive Apple enterprise expertise&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver technical presentations and executive workshops for enterprise prospects and customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Sales, Professional Services, and Product teams to architect custom Apple enterprise solutions spanning management, endpoint security, and network security&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain strategic partner relationships with complementary solution providers (Apple, Microsoft, CrowdStrike, Zscaler, Okta)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and deliver internal training and knowledge transfer on Apple enterprise best practices and emerging capabilities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create reusable implementation templates, automation tools, and methodologies for Apple enterprise deployments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as an escalation point for Sales, Marketing, and Product teams on Apple enterprise matters&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent Jamf as an Apple enterprise expert at industry events, conferences, and community forums&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive innovation initiatives to address gaps in current solutions or where no solution exists&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to product roadmap through field feedback and customer requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Active participation in professional development opportunities and industry training&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand cross-platform integration scenarios and coexistence strategies in enterprise environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Special projects assigned by management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What are we looking for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum of 5 years of professional experience in Apple device management, endpoint and/or network security (Required)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in consultative sales, pre-sales engineering, or technical sales support roles (Required)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced knowledge of Apple Enterprise Management technologies, endpoint protection, identity management, and zero-trust network architectures (Required)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced knowledge of Jamf products and solutions (Required)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced knowledge of IT ecosystem and key partner integrations/complementary solutions including but not limited to Apple, Okta, Microsoft, CrowdStrike, Zscaler, SIEM/SOAR (Preferred)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Specialized expertise in minimum 2 of the following areas: endpoint security architectures, identity and access management, zero-trust network architectures, SIEM/SOAR integration, API development and automation frameworks, Infrastructure as Code, emerging technologies (AI/ML, Apple Intelligence) (Preferred)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with scripting and automation languages (Go, Python, PowerShell, bash, Terraform, Ansible) and Apple developer languages (Swift, SwiftUI, Objective-C, Apple SDKs, Xcode) (Preferred)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience responding to RFPs and developing comprehensive solution proposals (Required)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to translate complex technical concepts into business outcomes for executives and decision-makers (Required)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong workshop and facilitation skills to align technical and business stakeholders (Preferred)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and oral communication skills in English (Required)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable engaging with a wide range of personnel, from technical to executive positions (Required)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience identifying solution gaps, ability to propose innovations, and execute subsequent implementation strategies (Preferred)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Active participation in the Apple enterprise community including conferences, forums, user groups, thought leadership content, or public speaking (Preferred)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education and certifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Secondary school diploma or equivalent (Required)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4 Year / Bachelor’s degree (or equivalent qualification) in Computer Science, Information Technology, or a related field (Preferred)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A combination of professional relevant experience and education may be considered&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Jamf Certifications 300, 370, 400 (Preferred)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relevant partner or security certifications aligned with focus area (Preferred)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commitment to maintaining current certifications and pursuing emerging technology education&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SECURITY AND PRIVACY REQUIREMENTS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participation in ongoing security training is mandatory.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Established security protocols will be adhered to, sensitive data will be handled responsibly, and data protection practices are followed, including understanding relevant privacy regulations and reporting breaches.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Acknowledging the Jamf Code of Conduct, where applicable security and privacy policies can be found, is a requirement of all roles at Jamf.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PHYSICAL REQUIREMENTS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to travel for customer visits, conferences, or internal events approximately 20% of the year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working hours may be required to accommodate regional business needs and collaboration with global teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5256&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5256&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;How we help you reach your best potential:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;11950&quot;&gt;We’re so proud to announce we&#39;ve been named in &lt;a class=&quot;_mizu1p6i _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _4bfu1r31 _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _syaz14q2 _ect41gqc _1a3b1r31 _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj14q2 _9oik1r31 _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l314q2 _1nrm1r31 _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h16c2 _1053w7te _1ienw7te _n0fxw7te _1vhvg3x0&quot; href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/G2/?hl=en&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;@G2&lt;/a&gt;&#39;s 2025 Best Software Awards for: &lt;br&gt;🏆 Best Software for Enterprise Business&lt;br&gt;🏆 Best Software for Mid-Market Business&lt;br&gt;🏆 Best Software Companies&lt;br&gt;🏆 Best IT Management Software Products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;12187&quot;&gt;Jamf is a 2024 TrustRadius Tech Cares Award Winner!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;12242&quot;&gt;Jamf Protect has received the honor of Endpoint Security Solution of the Year in&lt;br&gt;CyberSecurity Breakthrough Awards, 2022.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;12367&quot;&gt;Jamf Protect received the Security Software Solution of the Year, and Jamf Threat Defense has earned the title of Mobile Security Solution of the Year, in the 2022 Computer Security Awards.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What it means to be a Jamf?&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;We are a team of free-thinkers, can-doers, and problem-crushers. We value humility and the relentless pursuit of knowledge. Our culture flows from a spirit of selflessness and relentless self-improvement - driving both personal growth and collective progress throughout our company. We unite around common goals while respecting personal approaches, believing that fulfilled individuals create a thriving, vibrant workplace.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our aim is simple: hire exceptionally good people who are incredibly good at what they do and let them do it. We provide the support and resources to let everyone be their authentic, best selves at work, at rest, and at play. We are committed to supporting the continual improvement of Apple in the workplace, the organizations that rely on them and the people who keep it all running smoothly.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Above it all, waves our banner of #OneJamf – and the knowledge that when we stand together, we accomplish so much more than we could alone. We seek individuals who share this unwavering journey toward growth to join us in our quest for constant improvement.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What does Jamf do?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Jamf extends the legendary Apple experience people enjoy in their personal lives to the workplace. We believe the experience of using a device at work or school should feel the same, and be as secure as, using a personal device.&amp;nbsp;With Jamf, customers are able to confidently automate Mac, iPad, iPhone and Apple TV deployment, management, and security – anytime, anywhere – to protect the data and applications used by employees in the workplace, students learning in the classroom, and streamline communications in healthcare between patients and providers.&amp;nbsp;More than 2,500 Jamf strong worldwide, we are free-thinkers, can-doers, and problems crushers who are encouraged to bring their whole selves to work each and every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Get social with us and follow the conversation at #OneJamf&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;Jamf is committed to creating an inclusive &amp;amp; supportive work environment for all candidates and employees. Candidates with disabilities or religious beliefs are encouraged to reach out if they need additional support or alternative options to our recruiting processes to accommodate their disability or religious belief. If you need an accommodation, please contact your Recruiter or Recruiting Coordinator directly. Requests for accommodation will be handled confidentially by Recruiting and will not be shared with the hiring manager. Jamf is an equal opportunity employer and does not discriminate against individuals who request reasonable accommodation for disability or religious beliefs. To request accommodations please email us at &lt;a ----------
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred locations are Frankfurt,&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Berlin,&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Munich or Hanover; with domestic and occasional international travel as required.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As demand for high-performance, cross-border connectivity continues to grow, euNetworks expands its European presence. We are seeking a dynamic and commercially driven Account Director to join our European team in France or in Belgium, focusing on wholesale carriers and telecom resellers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a high-impact, customer-facing role responsible for both account management and new business development within the wholesale market. You’ll represent one of Europe’s most advanced fibre networks, delivering scalable, low-latency connectivity solutions across key routes and data centre hubs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll work closely with some of the most established names and fastest-growing players in the telecom sector, helping them access and resell high-capacity infrastructure services throughout Europe.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What will you be doing?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and grow strategic relationships with wholesale carriers and telecom resellers across Europe.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and win new business opportunities, positioning euNetworks’ long-haul and metro fibre services to support customer growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage existing accounts, ensuring strong customer satisfaction, revenue retention, and opportunity development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Position our European network solutions — including high-capacity, low-latency routes and unique data centre connectivity offerings — to meet evolving customer needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work cross-functionally with internal teams including Pre-Sales, Product, and Network Development to deliver tailored solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track and manage pipeline activity using Salesforce.com, ensuring accurate forecasting and data integrity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Attend and represent euNetworks at relevant industry events and forums across Europe.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What do we want from you?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record in Sales or Pre-sales (at least 8 years) preferably with wholesale carriers or with Service integrators.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of the telecoms market, particularly within the carrier and reseller ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of growing accounts and securing new logos in a competitive landscape.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to understand and position technical network solutions (e.g. wavelengths, dark fibre, Ethernet, IP transit) to a commercially savvy audience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in German and English, with effective communication and presentation skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-starter mindset — proactive, results-driven, and comfortable working in a fast-moving, cross-border environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If this position is of interest but you don’t think you meet all of the criteria listed, please consider applying still. euNetworks looks to recruit people with the right attitude, potential and ambition and for the right candidate, we will provide further training and support to enable you to develop in the role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What can we offer you?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At euNetworks we invest in our people by offering a range of benefits and development opportunities designed to support your professional growth and personal wellbeing. Employees have access to a comprehensive wellbeing programme that promotes mental health and also recognises the importance of work-life balance through initiatives such as a dedicated birthday day off and “give back” days to support volunteering activities. euNetworks’ bonus scheme is linked to both individual contribution and overall company performance with opportunity to overachieve in both areas. In addition, euNetworks operates a flexible hybrid working policy, enabling employees to balance in-office collaboration with remote work, fostering productivity, autonomy and a positive employee experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Family Friendly Policy delivers enhanced and inclusive parental benefits that can viewed &lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/1yM2VvLsByNiULKnRX9pIksCK0GI6FmO2/edit?usp=sharing&amp;amp;ouid=105588911760161167743&amp;amp;rtpof=true&amp;amp;sd=true&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Insurances, pensions, leave and additional enhancements are modelled to work with local country provisions, please email &lt;a ---------- for more details.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our company values drive our behaviour and form the basis of how we operate our business. We work as a team promoting a culture of collaboration, trust and respect where every individual is heard.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are proud to be an equal opportunity employer and commit to providing each individual with the support, continued learning and the tools to achieve their goals and an environment in which they can thrive.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We strive to make the hiring process equitable and accessible for all. Providing candidates with the opportunity to be their true selves and explore how you might thrive at euNetworks. We are a recognised Disability Confident employer and will make provisions where possible to support you through the interview process, if you require any reasonable accommodation through the selection process, please let your Talent Partner know.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At OpenUp, our mission is to make mental well-being accessible to everyone. Following a ‘high tech &amp;amp; high touch’ approach, we support companies, their employees, and their families with proactive and practical mental health services. Through our digital platform, clients can access 1:1 check-ins, online courses, articles, videos, group sessions, mindfulness practices, and a team of committed mental well-being experts. As we believe that mental and physical well-being are deeply connected, we have also added Lifestyle Experts to our offering, focusing on nutrition, exercise, and sleep. We offer a truly holistic approach that helps people take ownership of their health. We’re proud to work with forward-thinking organizations and are committed to raising the bar on accessible care.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;OpenUp was ranked in the Top 3 on LinkedIn’s Top Startups list for 2023, 2024 &amp;amp; 2025 and is continuously growing. We are expanding our international teams and we are searching for like-minded talent. We are already serving 2000+ companies (e.g. Rituals, Deloitte, Decathlon, KPMG, and McDonalds), through which 600K+ employees have access to our product.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re building out our presence in the DACH market and are looking for an entrepreneurial, purpose driven Sales Director to lead this market with us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you take full ownership of our commercial success in DACH. You coach and develop our Account Executives, shape our go to market strategy, and act as our trusted advisor on the German market for the wider organisation. This is not a &quot;manage and report&quot; role; it&#39;s an opportunity to build a market from the ground up and lead from the front, including closing deals yourself.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll work closely with our Business Development, Customer Success, and Marketing teams as part of a collaborative, international commercial team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the go to market strategy for the DACH region&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coach, develop, and grow a team of Account Executives (currently scaling from 2 to 6)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and expand the market, including new B2B partnerships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the internal advisor and voice of the German market for our (Dutch) headquarters&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take full ownership of the DACH sales function&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Close deals yourself, staying hands on and close to the market&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You genuinely enjoy working with people; you&#39;re energised by conversations, coaching your team, and building relationships at different levels.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You bring a combination of drive, curiosity, and resilience. You take ownership, learn from setbacks, and continuously look for ways to improve. You&#39;re comfortable operating in a fast paced, still to be built environment and enjoy being part of a team that builds together.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Mental well being resonates with you as something that matters and something you want to contribute to.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of leadership experience in B2B SaaS or tech sales, ideally within HR SaaS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A genuine hunter mentality and a strong instinct for go to market&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building or scaling a market or sales team from the ground up&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enthusiasm for staying personally involved in closing deals, not just leading from behind&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of the German market&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ambition paired with a warm, human way of leading people&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you can expect&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Joining OpenUp means being part of a fast-growing company that&#39;s doing something meaningful. You&#39;ll work with a diverse and international team. We like to have fun together with a lot of team building activities like our weekly ‘borrels’ and after work sport classes, the yearly ski-trip and our Padel tournament. Which makes our work fun, challenging and dynamic. Apart from this, we offer:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;€1500 annual personal development budget&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;ClassPass: OpenUp contributes towards your classpass membership&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monthly home internet/phone contribution (50EUR)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Daily healthy and vegetarian lunch at our Amsterdam office.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Regular office yoga, meditation classes or breathing exercises (at our Amsterdam office)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible work model (hybrid and options for remote work).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monthly drinks and company wide summer fest and other fun activities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;27.5 vacation days per year.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free and unlimited access for you and your family to all our products, including our psychologists.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Next steps&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Inspired to be part of OpenUp? We’d love to hear your story. Apply via our website and we’ll get in touch soon.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have questions, please visit our &lt;a href=&quot;https://openup.com/nl/veelgestelde-vragen/&quot;&gt;FAQ page&lt;/a&gt; or reach out directly.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;At OpenUp, everyone is welcome to apply regardless of age, gender, background, nationality, or any other characteristic. What matters to us is high performance, a real drive to make an impact and the ambition to become the European market leader. If you&#39;re ready to OpenUp, join us!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We may use artificial intelligence (AI) tools to streamline parts of our recruitment process. These tools assist our recruitment team but do not replace human judgement. All hiring decisions are made by humans. If you would like more information about how we use AI in the process, please contact us.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;At OpenUp, we believe mental well-being should be as accessible and normal as going to the gym. Our mission is simple but ambitious: to make mental well-being available to everyone.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;We partner with companies to support their employees and families through proactive, practical mental health services. Our platform brings together 1:1 check-ins, courses, content, group sessions, and mindfulness practices - all supported by a dedicated network of experts. We take a holistic view, connecting mental and physical well-being through lifestyle coaching focused on sleep, nutrition, and exercise.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Today, we support over 1,500 companies and 500,000+ employees globally, including Rituals, Deloitte, Decathlon, KPMG, and McDonald’s. Recognised as a Top 3 LinkedIn Startup in 2023, 2024 and 2025 - and we&#39;ve got big plans to keep growing our client-base, which is where this role comes into play.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your opportunity:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;We’re growing our presence in the DACH market and are looking for entrepreneurial, purpose-driven Account Executives to help build this market with us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;In this role, you own the full sales cycle end-to-end - from identifying opportunities and opening conversations, through to closing deals and building long-term relationships. This is not a “plug-and-play” sales role; it’s an opportunity to shape how we grow in DACH.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;You’ll work closely with our Business Development, Customer Success, and Marketing teams as part of a collaborative, international commercial team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive new business by identifying and engaging potential clients across the DACH region&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and expand a strong network of B2B partnerships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Grow existing accounts by spotting expansion opportunities (including international rollouts)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a trusted first point of contact for your customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;What you&#39;ll bring to our team:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;You genuinely enjoy working with people; you’re energised by conversations, building relationships, and connecting with stakeholders at different levels.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;You bring a combination of drive, curiosity, and resilience. You take ownership, learn from setbacks, and continuously look for ways to improve. You’re comfortable operating in a fast-paced environment and enjoy being part of a team that builds together.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;Mental well-being resonates with you as something that matters and something you want to contribute to.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience in sales (ideally B2B SaaS or high-growth environments)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong relationship-building skills - you’re a natural, confident and engaging networker&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience - or interest - in building a network within HR or People teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven success in closing deals with medium- to large-enterprises&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A structured, action-oriented way of working and a relationship-focussed sales approach&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enthusiasm for working in a highly dynamic, AI-forward international environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with tools like Salesforce, HubSpot, or Pipedrive&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent language skills in both German and English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll get as part of our team:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;You’ll join a company that combines commercial ambition with meaningful impact. We move fast, support each other, and make time to celebrate along the way.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;Alongside a competitive salary and bonus structure, we offer:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;€1500 annual personal development budget&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribution to your ClassPass membership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;€50 monthly internet/phone allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Daily healthy, vegetarian lunch at the office&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Regular yoga, meditation, and breathing sessions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible hybrid working model&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monthly drinks, summer events, ski trips, and padel tournaments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;27.5 vacation days per year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free and unlimited access to OpenUp for you and your family, including sessions with psychologists&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Next steps:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Inspired to be part of OpenUp? We’d love to hear your story. Apply via our website and we’ll get in touch soon.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have questions, please visit our &lt;a href=&quot;https://openup.com/nl/veelgestelde-vragen/&quot;&gt;FAQ page&lt;/a&gt; or reach out directly.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;At OpenUp, everyone is welcome to apply regardless of age, gender, background, nationality, or any other characteristic. What matters to us is high performance, a real drive to make an impact and the ambition to become the European market leader. If you&#39;re ready to OpenUp, join us!&lt;/p&gt;
