&lt;p data-start=&quot;2886&quot; data-end=&quot;2976&quot;&gt;You combine strategic thinking with strong execution and are motivated to build a company.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;6l4sas&quot; data-start=&quot;2978&quot; data-end=&quot;3017&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2982&quot; data-end=&quot;3017&quot;&gt;We are looking for someone who:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;3018&quot; data-end=&quot;3287&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;v2ttr4&quot; data-start=&quot;3018&quot; data-end=&quot;3062&quot;&gt;Is entrepreneurial, hands-on, and driven&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;2xh95s&quot; data-start=&quot;3063&quot; data-end=&quot;3112&quot;&gt;Thrives in fast-paced, ambiguous environments&lt;/li&gt;
