&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;sc-gEkIjz cjtSrT MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 sc-hoLEA&quot;&gt;Raisin is the world’s leading platform for savings and investment products. Founded in 2012, the&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;FinTech&lt;/strong&gt; connects consumers with banks in the EU, the UK and the US. This gives consumers &lt;strong&gt;better interest rates&lt;/strong&gt; and banks a &lt;strong&gt;diversified form of refinancing&lt;/strong&gt;. Our vision is to offer savings and investments without barriers and thus open up the global 160 trillion euro market.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;sc-gEkIjz cjtSrT MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 sc-hoLEA&quot;&gt;Raisin currently employs more than 800 people from over 75 countries worldwide. Today, the platform holds over 80 billion euros in assets from&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;more than one million investors&lt;/strong&gt; which have accrued over 5 billion euros in returns.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Join our Talent Pool to hear about opportunities across Raisin group!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.raisin.com/corporate/raisin-applicant-privacy-policy/&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Raisin Applicant Privacy Policy&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;728&quot; data-end=&quot;900&quot;&gt;We value diversity and the unique experiences each individual brings. If you’re excited about this role but don’t meet every requirement, we still encourage you to apply.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;907&quot; data-end=&quot;1013&quot;&gt;We are an equal opportunity employer and are committed to creating an inclusive environment for everyone, regardless of race, colour, ancestry, religion, sex, national origin, sexual orientation, age, citizenship, marital status, disability, or gender identity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the job&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Are you interested in challenging projects, technical innovation, implementing new ideas and solving complex problems?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our software,&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Miles&lt;/strong&gt;, is an ERP software for finance, leasing, fleet and mobility management in the automotive industry. It is a complex end-to-end solution that includes front, mid and back office functions and can be extensively customized to the customer&#39;s needs through configuration. Our customers are leasing and financing companies from the automotive industry.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Implementation Consultant&lt;/strong&gt;, you will be part of a dynamic multidisciplinary unit and play a key role in creating, configuring, and assembling the foundational components of Sofico’s solution to support and enhance business processes. By collaborating closely with clients and project teams, you will design, implement, and deliver tailored solutions that meet the customer needs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your responsibilities will include:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze and refine customer requirements into detailed functional and system specifications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assess existing Miles functionality and propose effective solution directions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop, execute and document configuration solution designs in collaboration with stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct unit testing to ensure quality and reliability of configured solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure timely delivery and successful handover of solutions to customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support data migration, document management, and reporting from an in-depth understanding of customer solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Product Managers to align project solutions with the product’s roadmap and future developments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor junior consultants and contribute to best practices and knowledge sharing across teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead workshops and customer engagements to drive solution adoption and success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your skills and interests:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You like to work on impactful projects in a dynamic and innovative environment, and are driven by collaboration with passionate professionals and contributing to delivering solutions that drive customer success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What else is expected:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Business fluent in&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;English&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience in a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;configuration or implementation consulting role&lt;/strong&gt;, preferably in a tech-driven environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiar with&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;software implementation lifecycle&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills with the ability to translate business requirements into technical solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;system configuration, testing, and documentation&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;leading projects or mentoring team members&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;is a strong advantage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What we offer&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We would like to welcome you to an&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;international and multicultural company&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;that has been operating for over 30 years and is doubling in size every 5 years. Growth is our middle name, while we strongly adhere to our&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;horizontal and open company culture&lt;/strong&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;re in the drivers&#39; seat of your own career, that&#39;s our motto. Your&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;personal development&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;is therefore paramount. During an extensive&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;onboarding program&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;of six months, we make you, with the support of your&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;job coach&lt;/strong&gt;, familiar with our product and the organization. Even after this period, you will continue to get opportunities to learn and develop yourself further. You’re&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;never alone&lt;/strong&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Sofico you will also work in a modern state-of-the-art office that is easily&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;accessible&lt;/strong&gt;. We have plenty of safe charging points for your electric car.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In return for your efforts, we offer an&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;extensive salary package&lt;/strong&gt;, including a company car, pension scheme and medical insurance. The &lt;strong&gt;flexible office hours&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;hybrid working policy&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;provide the necessary flexibility within the company.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Sofico we are strong believers in the power of a good cup of coffee. Water or soft drinks are of course also on the menu. We love our&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;team events&lt;/strong&gt;. Think after-work drinks, a BBQ, a family day, a company weekend, or a walking dinner with the whole company.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the job&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are the expert navigator for our most complex client projects. As a Senior Implementation Consultant, you leverage your deep industry knowledge and technical expertise to steer global automotive and leasing giants through critical software implementations. You don&#39;t just configure a system; you design the future operational landscape of our clients. In this pivotal role within a hidden champion of mobility tech, you act as a mentor to your team and a strategic partner to our customers, ensuring that our software &quot;&lt;strong&gt;Miles&lt;/strong&gt;&quot; delivers maximum impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your responsibilities will include:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute in large-scale implementation projects, from initial scoping to final delivery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You analyze intricate business requirements and design sophisticated solutions that push the boundaries of what is possible with Miles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You act as a primary point of contact for key stakeholders, managing expectations and building strong, trust-based relationships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You mentor and coach junior and mid-level consultants, fostering a culture of excellence and continuous learning within the team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You identify opportunities for process improvements and contribute to the strategic roadmap of our implementation methodology&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You collaborate closely with product management and development teams to translate market needs into new software features&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your skills and interests:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have built an impressive track record in software implementation, IT consulting, or business analysis over several years&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You possess expert-level knowledge of the automotive finance, leasing, or fleet management industry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You thrive in challenging environments and have successfully managed complex projects with multiple stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are passionate about sharing your knowledge and have experience in leading or mentoring teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You combine strong analytical skills with a pragmatic, solution-oriented mindset&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To be eligible, you must be an Australian Citizen, Permanent Resident, or have your own pathway to PR. Unfortunately, we are unable to offer visa sponsorship for this role.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Sofico, you’ll join an international, multicultural company with over 30 years of success. We double in size every five years, staying true to our open and collaborative culture even as we grow.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe you should be in control of your own career. That’s why we put your personal development first. With an extensive onboarding program, you’ll spend six months learning our products and getting to know the organization with the support of a dedicated job coach. Your learning doesn’t stop there; we’ll continue to offer opportunities for growth and development throughout your career.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll work in a modern, accessible office with flexible and hybrid work options that allow you to balance work and life. In addition, we offer:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy continuous opportunities for learning and professional growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Onsite parking, EV Charging and walking distance from metro.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Benefit from a competitive salary, flexible office hours&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access novated leasing options and mobile phone reimbursement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy complimentary coffee, soft drinks, breakfast and fruit&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;WFH 2 days per week&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in team events, including afterwork drinks, BBQs, family days, and company weekends.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;The Senior Insights Data Analyst is a key contributor responsible for delivering complex data analytics projects and providing strategic insights that drive business decisions. Sitting at the intersection of operations, business intelligence, and tech, this role will serve as the driver for fast-paced, complex, and ambitious projects. With a strong command of statistical techniques and tools, this individual works with cross-functional teams to gather data, apply advanced analytical frameworks, and develop actionable insights that align with the company&#39;s strategic goals. This role works with minimal supervision, ensuring data accuracy and optimizing business processes through data-driven decision-making.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;While not responsible for managing a team, the Senior Insights Analyst mentors junior analysts and collaborates closely with business leaders to deliver impactful results. The ideal candidate brings deep domain knowledge, a proactive mindset, and the confidence to share findings and influence decisions — even when not asked.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Be Doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and drive projects with minimal supervision, executing complex data queries and advanced analytical frameworks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Transform ambiguous business challenges into viable analytical solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply statistical techniques and AI to address business challenges, providing clear, data-driven insights to guide decision-making&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Effectively structure projects, manage timelines, and provide relevant updates to key stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertly steer meetings and communicate findings to both technical and non-technical stakeholders through visualizations and presentations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Process, transform, and clean large datasets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand HF&#39;s core products and business model, with a focus on optimizing operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor junior analysts, providing guidance and support in their development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years experience in reporting, BI, data analysis, or a similar position with an operations focus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced ability to model real-life business operations using assumptions and historical data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced ability to utilize large language models to guide and enhance tasks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced understanding of inferential statistics for advanced analytics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient with SQL, Python, and data visualization tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong autonomy and proactive communication skills, with the confidence to share findings and challenge assumptions unprompted&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curious mindset with a proactive approach to problem-solving and expanding knowledge and skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Domain knowledge relevant to operations (e.g. procurement, inventory management, production, logistics)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will get in return:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;● 70% off HelloFresh or Green Chef boxes&lt;br&gt;● Company pension scheme&lt;br&gt;● Gym membership&lt;br&gt;● Bupa private medical insurance (including dental &amp;amp; family cover options)&lt;br&gt;● Mental health first aiders and an employee assistance programme&lt;br&gt;● Dog friendly office! (London site only)&lt;br&gt;● Nursery support scheme&lt;br&gt;● Cycle to work scheme&lt;br&gt;● Group Life Assurance&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location&lt;/strong&gt;: The HelloFresh Farm, 60 Worship Street, EC2A 2EZ, London&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;To be considered for this role, you’ll need to have the independent right to work in the UK, as we&#39;re unfortunately unable to provide sponsorship at this time.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Hybrid Working Policy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;We offer a hybrid working policy for eligible roles, allowing flexibility to work from home and in the office. For more details on eligibility and how this applies to the role you&#39;re applying for, please consult with your recruiter.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Next steps&lt;/strong&gt;: Your application will be reviewed and if successful, a member of the Talent Acquisition Team will be in touch within 2 weeks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are required to cooperate with HelloFresh in all health and safety matters. You are responsible for ensuring you take reasonable care of your own health, and safety as well as others who may be affected by the work activities you undertake. You must report incidents immediately and actively raise health and safety-related concerns to your Line Manager.&amp;nbsp;As part of our commitment to maintaining a safe and secure environment, we will process Disclosure and Barring Service (&lt;span class=&quot;il&quot;&gt;DBS&lt;/span&gt;) checks to the successful individual. Failure to disclose relevant information at application or throughout the process could affect your employment with the company.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you are currently a HelloFresh employee, please make sure you have discussed your application with your Line Manager.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Title:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Junior Maintenance Engineer&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location: &lt;/strong&gt;Smart parc, Spondon, Derby DE21 7HW&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shift Pattern: &lt;/strong&gt;Suez Shift Pattern rotating&amp;nbsp;days and nights, 0600-1800 and 1800-0600.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Let&#39;s Discuss What&#39;s On The Table For You:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;● 70% off HelloFresh or Green Chef boxes&lt;br&gt;● Company pension scheme&lt;br&gt;● Gym membership&lt;br&gt;● Bupa private medical insurance (including dental &amp;amp; family cover options)&lt;br&gt;● Mental health first aiders and an employee assistance programme&lt;br&gt;● Nursery support scheme&lt;br&gt;● Cycle to work scheme&lt;br&gt;● Group Life Assurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Play a key part in supporting our Employee Resource Groups: FreshVets, Black Heritage Network, NEU Network (Neurodiversity), GET (Gender Equality Team) and FreshPride&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About The Job:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Junior Engineer to be responsible for fixing, maintaining and improving our equipment on site to make sure everything is working as it should at all times.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Junior Engineer will be responsible for completing reactive and preventative works across the site, reporting defects to contractors, assisting contractors, keeping up to date on defect tickets raised on our CMMS system and following the sites Health and Safety rules.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Be Doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform planned preventative maintenance (PPM) on plant and equipment, including automated conveying systems, gravity conveying systems with label applicators scanners, thermoforming equipment, refrigeration plant (CO2), hi-speed roller doors, dock levellers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify defects that arise while completing PPMs and undertake rectifications, recording actions taken in the maintenance manual and CMMS system.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct minor structural and electrical improvement works.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide reactive support when required, including breakdown response, and ensure high standards and timely completion of work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supervise contractors to ensure works are completed in accordance with the specification, and report any issues with contractors to maintenance manager.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comply with all Health and Safety requirements of the site at all times.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work proactively with maintenance shift manager to manage task volumes, provide regular updates on task status, and identify problems with plant efficiency and determine rectification measures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support operational projects on an ad-hoc basis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flag low stock levels to ensure inventory stays within min-max levels using our CMMS system.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactive, detail-oriented, and able to work in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills and ability to work well both independently and as part of a team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong commitment to health and safety.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous experience in maintenance or engineering field preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of automated systems and PLC controls.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in electrical and mechanical maintenance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Basic computer skills with experience in CMMS or similar systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexibility to work shifts and weekends as required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Next steps&lt;/strong&gt;: Your application will be reviewed and if successful, a member of the Talent Acquisition Team will be in touch within 2 weeks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;To be considered for this role, you’ll need to have the independent right to work in the UK, as we&#39;re unfortunately unable to provide sponsorship at this time.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are required to cooperate with HelloFresh in all health and safety matters. You are responsible for ensuring you take reasonable care of your own health, and safety as well as others who may be affected by the work activities you undertake. You must report incidents immediately and actively raise health and safety-related concerns to your Line Manager. As part of our commitment to maintaining a safe and secure environment, we will process Disclosure and Barring Service (DBS) checks to the successful individual. Failure to disclose relevant information at application or throughout the process could affect your employment with the company.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join Axon and be a Force for Good.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Axon, we’re on a mission to Protect Life. We’re explorers, pursuing society’s most critical safety and justice issues with our ecosystem of devices and cloud software. Like our products, we work better together. We connect with candor and care, seeking out diverse perspectives from our customers, communities and each other.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Life at Axon is fast-paced, challenging and meaningful. Here, you’ll take ownership and drive real change. Constantly grow as you work hard for a mission that matters at a company where you matter.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;JOB DESCRIPTION&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Manager, International Indirect Tax&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Location: Mon remotely, Tue-Fri in-office (London, Amsterdam, Frankfurt, or Madrid)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reporting to: VP, Tax&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reports: no formal direct reports, with broad influence on the global tax organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Axon, we are on a mission to Protect Life. We build and deploy technology across public safety and justice, and we hold ourselves to high standards in how we operate — including in how we manage our obligations as a global business.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Axon is seeking a Senior Manager, International Indirect Tax to lead the company&#39;s international VAT and indirect tax function, encompassing all non-US VAT and indirect taxes. The role carries overall responsibility for the quality and accuracy of all indirect tax compliance output, as well as providing advisory support to internal teams on indirect tax matters arising from contracts, new market entry, entity set-up, and tax law changes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The successful candidate will be commercially minded, technically strong across European and global VAT systems, experienced in indirect tax compliance, and confident advising Finance, Legal, and Commercial colleagues without requiring escalation. The role supervises three indirect tax team members, reporting directly to the Vice President, Tax.&amp;nbsp; Experience in a hardware and software business with a complex supply chain is highly desired.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Internal Advisory&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the primary point of contact for non-US indirect tax queries across Finance, Legal, and Commercial teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Liaise with sales teams and other partners to understand upstream sales processes that impact indirect tax operationalization and compliance matters.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advise on the VAT treatment of customer contracts, pricing structures, and invoicing arrangements, working directly with Sales and Legal as required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide VAT guidance on new product lines and SKU launches, including taxability assessments and sales tax code assignments in D365.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent the indirect tax function in e-invoicing projects and regulatory change programmes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the business through tax authority audits, enquiries, and disputes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor legislative developments across relevant jurisdictions and communicate implications to the business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advise and inform management on growing areas of focus in non-US indirect compliance and audits, technology trends and solutions, and process improvements.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compliance Oversight&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review and approve all indirect tax compliance deliverables — VAT returns, Intrastat, OSS, and ESL — across all in-scope jurisdictions, with full accountability for accuracy and submission deadlines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee indirect tax accounting, including journal entries, balance sheet reconciliations, and BlackLine certification.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain the compliance calendar and validate data quality across all submissions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor VAT payments and refunds; liaise with local tax authorities where required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide guidance to Finance and operational teams on compliance requirements as they arise.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;New Entity Set-Up&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the indirect tax workstream for all new entity formations, covering VAT registration, system readiness, and the preparation of compliant workpaper frameworks prior to first filing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review and approve invoice templates for new entities before they commence trading.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure SOX and internal control obligations are met across all indirect tax processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Process and Systems&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and implement improvements to VAT filing workflows, including the use of AI, macros, Alteryx, and D365 configuration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in or lead system testing for indirect tax-related ERP and reporting changes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain commodity code tax tables and item sales tax code frameworks in D365.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure processes are documented and structured to support an expanding compliance footprint.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A minimum of 10 years&#39; experience in VAT or indirect tax, gained in-house at a multinational or in a professional services environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Detailed working knowledge of VAT across multiple European jurisdictions, including Intrastat, OSS, and ESL reporting obligations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrable experience reviewing and approving compliance deliverables prepared by others, with personal accountability for quality and timeliness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience advising on the indirect tax treatment of commercial contracts, pricing arrangements, and customer invoicing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing the indirect tax aspects of new entity set-ups, including VAT registration and process build-out.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Microsoft D365 or a comparable ERP; working knowledge of BlackLine, Sigma, and Alteryx is advantageous.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of SOX internal control requirements in a tax context.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to communicate clearly on technical VAT matters to non-specialist colleagues across Legal, Finance, and Commercial functions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing and leading a team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Don’t meet every single requirement? That&#39;s ok. At Axon, we Aim Far. We think big with a long-term view because we want to reinvent the world to be a safer, better place. We are also committed to building diverse teams that reflect the communities we serve.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Studies have shown that women and people of color are less likely to apply to jobs unless they check every box in the job description. If you’re excited about this role and our mission to Protect Life but your experience doesn’t align perfectly with every qualification listed here, we encourage you to apply anyways. You may be just the right candidate for this or other roles.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Important Notes&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;The above job description is not intended as, nor should it be construed as, exhaustive of all duties, responsibilities, skills, efforts, or working conditions associated with this job. The job description may change or be supplemented at any time in accordance with business needs and conditions.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Some roles may also require legal eligibility to work in a firearms environment.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We collect personal information from applicants to evaluate candidates for employment. You may request access, deletion, or exercise other CCPA rights at&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link c-link--underline&quot; ----- target=&quot;_blank&quot; ----- ----- via our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link c-link--underline&quot; href=&quot;https://privacyportal.onetrust.com/webform/0efc1702-9321-4119-bc9d-a06c3a1d3e4e/ca57cc26-a159-4193-9f6e-58ffe3fd2509&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://privacyportal.onetrust.com/webform/0efc1702-9321-4119-bc9d-a06c3a1d3e4e/ca57cc26-a159-4193-9f6e-58ffe3fd2509&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Axon Privacy Web Form&lt;/a&gt;. For more information, please see the Your California Privacy Rights section of our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link c-link--underline&quot; href=&quot;https://www.axon.com/candidateprivacypolicy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.axon.com/candidateprivacypolicy&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Applicant and Candidate Privacy Notice.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Axon’s mission is to Protect Life and is committed to the well-being and safety of its employees as well as Axon’s impact on the environment. All Axon employees must be aware of and committed to the appropriate environmental, health, and safety regulations, policies, and procedures. Axon employees are empowered to report safety concerns as they arise and activities potentially impacting the environment.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We are an equal opportunity employer that promotes justice, advances equity, values diversity and fosters inclusion. We’re committed to hiring the best talent — regardless of race, creed, color, ancestry, religion, sex (including pregnancy), national origin, sexual orientation, age, citizenship status, marital status, disability, gender identity, genetic information, veteran status, or any other characteristic protected by applicable laws, regulations and ordinances — and empowering all of our employees so they can do their best work. If you have a disability or special need that requires assistance or accommodation during the application or the recruiting process, please email &lt;a ---------- &lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;Please note that this email address is for accommodation purposes only. Axon will not respond to inquiries for other purposes.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Phishing alert:&amp;nbsp; Axon will never ask you to pay for any part of the hiring process, including training, equipment, or background checks. We do not make job offers via text message, WhatsApp, or instant messaging platforms without a formal interview process.&amp;nbsp; All legitimate job openings are listed on our official careers page at &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.axon.com/careers&quot;&gt;https://www.axon.com/careers&lt;/a&gt;. &amp;nbsp;If you receive a suspicious offer or outreach from an email address that is not ----- or if you are asked for sensitive personal information (bank details, Social Security Number) prematurely, please ignore the message and report it to &lt;a ----------
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;About Eucalyptus&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re on a mission to make good health last a lifetime. More than 1 billion people live with obesity worldwide, driving preventable chronic conditions. We&#39;re here to build better long-term care.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Eucalyptus is now part of Hims &amp;amp; Hers, the global leader in personalised health and wellness.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Euc is the company behind Juniper, one of the world&#39;s largest weight-management programs combining GLP-1 medication with personalised nutrition, movement support, and clinician-led care from prescribers, nurses, health coaches, pharmacists, and dietitians. Our published clinical research shows that our combined clinical and behavioural approach helps patients lose significantly more weight during their treatment with Juniper by four times.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Our Growth Story:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supporting patients living with obesity across our 5 markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Received selective NICE endorsement to provide services to the NHS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tailored our offering to thousands of patients in Australia, the UK, Germany, Japan and Canada.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;People arrive at our pages ready to change their health, and unsure whether to begin. Starting a treatment that could change your life is a big decision, and often a frightening one. Your job is to help them take the first step.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a Senior Product Designer role for someone who can make that moment clear, credible and human. You design the surfaces where people decide to start, some of the highest-stakes creative work we have, and you can measure your impact in the number of people who begin.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;notion-enable-hover&quot; data-token-index=&quot;0&quot;&gt;In this role, you will:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design every page as an argument. Every element earns its place: the problem, the solution, the proof, the process, the value, and the blockers you remove.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own our highest-leverage acquisition surfaces end to end: landing pages, the signature conversion components on them, and the templates they sit in.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the conversion-bearing pieces others don&#39;t, e.g. BMI calculators and the interstitial moments that carry someone through a clinical quiz and consult form, the points where people hesitate and leave.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make the case on every surface. Meet someone where they are in their decision and build a clear, structured argument for why to start, built around them, not a list of features.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate clinical language into words a patient understands and trusts. Accurate, compliant and human at once.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design dense information like an infographic: communicate a lot, simply. Data visualisation and strong hierarchy in place of walls of text, without losing the detail. Our patients care about the detail, so your job is to convey it clearly, not to oversimplify.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lean on interaction design to carry the detail. Progressive disclosure, reveals and interactive data let people go as deep as they want, without meeting it all at once.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use motion and pacing with intent. You control the rhythm of a page and the beat between steps, so people keep moving.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Carry the creative set from our adverts through to the landing page and the touchpoints after it. One unbroken story from ad to conversion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner your CRO manager on the optimisation loop. You bring the hypothesis and the design, shape the tests and read what comes back, and turn the result into the next move.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help more people start. That is the number you move, and you always know why it moved.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Earn trust with evidence: multiple, specific proof points, not a logo and a star rating, all holding up in a regulated market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;notion-enable-hover&quot; data-token-index=&quot;0&quot;&gt;What good looks like&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;notion-enable-hover&quot; data-token-index=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Scope:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; you own the front door. The acquisition surfaces where people decide whether to begin, and the design-led testing that keeps them improving.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;notion-enable-hover&quot; data-token-index=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Impact:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; you help more people get started. At our scale that reaches into millions of lives, real people beginning a treatment that changes theirs. You move that number, and you can show the before and after.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;notion-enable-hover&quot; data-token-index=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Influence:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; you work alongside growth experts, CROs, and product and commercial partners. You hold the bar on what is right for the patient, balancing it against the needs of the business. You bring people with you by offering options and choices, gaining buy-in with evidence rather than force. And you raise the bar inside the design team too, giving sharp critique and making the designers around you better.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;notion-enable-hover&quot; data-token-index=&quot;0&quot;&gt;About you (who you are)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The best person for this role has a rare mix. You make dense, complex medical information simple and clear, without dumbing it down or losing what matters. You are doing this for people at a vulnerable moment, so empathy and emotional intelligence are critical. You read the emotion in a health decision and meet people where they are, with warmth and without judgement. And you are deeply curious about health. You do not need to arrive knowing the conditions we treat, only the drive to understand them. You pair all of that with sharp acquisition craft and the discipline to test. You hold the human and the commercial in the same hand.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;notion-enable-hover&quot; data-token-index=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Skills &amp;amp; experience&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;notion-enable-hover&quot; data-token-index=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Problem definition.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; You shape the problem, not just the pixels. You use data and research to work out which surface matters most and which experiment is worth running, then package it into something the team can build. The signal is evidence you helped define the right test, not just made the variant.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;notion-enable-hover&quot; data-token-index=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Visual craft.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; Non-negotiable. Typography, spacing, colour, motion and micro-interactions, used with intent, not decoration. This role also carries the interstitial illustration in the quiz and consult flow, so you make that visual work yourself. Weak craft is a no, whatever the conversion talk.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;notion-enable-hover&quot; data-token-index=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Accessibility.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;You design inclusively without being asked. You know why the standard exists, not just what it says, and it shows in judgement calls a checklist cannot make.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;notion-enable-hover&quot; data-token-index=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Systems thinking.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; You think in modules, not single pages. You compose from the design system&#39;s primitives, own the signature, conversion-bearing components built on top, and build page templates that assemble in different ways to serve different needs. Modularity is your default and it keeps you fast, but you build bespoke, ground-up pages when a high-profile moment deserves the craft. You extend the system rather than reinvent it, and you keep a clean line between the atomic layer the system owns and the bespoke pieces you own. Infrastructure compounds. Single screens do not.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;notion-enable-hover&quot; data-token-index=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Product and commercial sense.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; You reason in conversion rate, cost per acquisition and funnel drop-off. You know which page matters most to the business and why, and you defend a design decision in the language of the metric it moves. Craft in isolation moves nothing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;notion-enable-hover&quot; data-token-index=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Communication.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;Clear, specific, opinionated. You say what you decided and why, and you are just as clear on what you chose not to do and why.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;notion-enable-hover&quot; data-token-index=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Working in the open.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; You share early and often, and you use critique to sharpen the work. You lift the quality of every review you join.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;notion-enable-hover&quot; data-token-index=&quot;0&quot;&gt;How you work with AI&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;LLMs are already embedded in your workflow. You use them to widen the range of variants you can test and to tighten the build-measure-learn loop.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You prototype in tools like Claude Code and Cursor to test ideas in real code, not just mock them up.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The signal is workflow, not tool count. Judgement spent where it counts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;notion-enable-hover&quot; data-token-index=&quot;0&quot;&gt;The full stack&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We expect you to work end to end, from problem definition and research to information architecture and UX writing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Validation and experimentation is the core of the role. You design A/B tests, size them, and read them honestly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Your own research and usability testing, feeding the next experiment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Copywriting and UX writing. You write the words that persuade and the words that guide, and both hold up in a regulated market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Composition from the design system, and ownership of the signature components and templates built on top of it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;notion-enable-hover&quot; data-token-index=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Your portfolio&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Show us work where you took something complex and made it land. A page that told a clear story, held the detail without overwhelming, and helped a real person make a decision. We want the craft on the surface, the words weighted as heavily as the graphics, and evidence you designed with empathy for people at a moment that mattered. Show the outcome too: the number you moved and the testing that got you there. Applications without a portfolio will not be considered.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Typically 5 to 8 years in product design, with a track record of conversion-focused design and A/B testing on acquisition surfaces.&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;notion-enable-hover&quot; data-token-index=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Behaviours &amp;amp; attitude&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;notion-enable-hover&quot; data-token-index=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Patient-first mindset.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; You put patient outcomes first. Every decision weighs commercial growth against clinical safety and care, and you don&#39;t let one erode the other. You understand real health journeys well enough to make them simple, accessible and worth trusting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;notion-enable-hover&quot; data-token-index=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Collaborative creation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; You work well across product, engineering and clinical, and you know a good idea can come from any of them. You listen to feedback and take it on, using it to make the work better.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;notion-enable-hover&quot; data-token-index=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Curiosity.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; You ask why before how. You stay curious about the patient, the problem and the tools you use to solve it, and you&#39;re comfortable being a beginner when something new is worth learning.&lt;br&gt;Typically 5 to 8 years in product design, with a track record of conversion-focused design and A/B testing on acquisition surfaces.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why join Eucalyptus?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Euc is also behind a growing family of digital healthcare clinics (&lt;a href=&quot;https://pilot.com.au/&quot;&gt;Pilot,&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.kinfertility.com.au/&quot;&gt;Kin&lt;/a&gt;,&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;http://skin.software/&quot;&gt;Software&lt;/a&gt;) across men’s health and well-being, fertility, and skincare.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Here’s what makes joining Euc unique:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What’s next&lt;/strong&gt; - Our goal for the next three years is to support &lt;strong&gt;1 million patients globally&lt;/strong&gt; to live better for longer. We’re launching into new conditions, demographics, and geographies as we build a truly preventive healthcare ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build something world-changing&lt;/strong&gt; - We’re on the path to becoming the world’s largest international digital healthcare company. It will be challenging, fast-paced, and deeply rewarding.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Make real impact&lt;/strong&gt; - You will deliver work that directly shapes patient outcomes and scales evidence-based care across markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Accelerate your growth&lt;/strong&gt; - You will have high ownership, continuous feedback, and dedicated development support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join a motivated team&lt;/strong&gt; - You will collaborate with talented peers to solve complex clinical and operational problems at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What’s ahead in the UK&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Be an owner&lt;/strong&gt; – Your own stake in the business with our employee options program&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Invest in your growth&lt;/strong&gt; – Annual development budget plus 3 days of professional development leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work flexibly&lt;/strong&gt; – Hybrid setup with 3 days a week in our Old Street office, designed for focus and collaboration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Support your well-being&lt;/strong&gt; – Private health insurance through Vitality or opt for a monthly wellness allowance to spend on what matters most to you&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Take time off&lt;/strong&gt; – 25 days of holiday, enhanced parental leave and work from anywhere 3 weeks out of the year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join a connected team&lt;/strong&gt; – A vibrant office culture with regular socials, clubs, after-school sport, and seasonal events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;At Eucalyptus, we value individuals from all backgrounds, experiences, and perspectives, and we embrace the unique qualities each person brings. When you apply, please let us know of any reasonable adjustments you may need during the interview process. We use AI-assisted tools across our business to help our teams work more efficiently, including within our recruitment process. These tools support our team — all hiring decisions are made by real people, and every application is reviewed by a member of our recruitment team.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;About Eucalyptus&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re on a mission to make good health last a lifetime. More than 1 billion people live with obesity worldwide, driving preventable chronic conditions. We&#39;re here to build better long-term care.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Eucalyptus is now part of Hims &amp;amp; Hers, the global leader in personalised health and wellness.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Euc is the company behind Juniper, one of the world&#39;s largest weight-management programs combining GLP-1 medication with personalised nutrition, movement support, and clinician-led care from prescribers, nurses, health coaches, pharmacists, and dietitians. Our published clinical research shows that our combined clinical and behavioural approach helps patients lose significantly more weight during their treatment with Juniper by four times.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Our Growth Story:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supporting patients living with obesity across our 5 markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Received selective NICE endorsement to provide services to the NHS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tailored our offering to thousands of patients in Australia, the UK, Germany, Japan and Canada.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for an exceptional Paid Search Lead to own and scale our search channel growth in the UK market. This is a high-impact, hands-on growth role where you&#39;ll be responsible for scaling performance across the Google ecosystem — leveraging deep expertise across all Google products, from Search to Performance Max — to drive sustainable, compliant growth in one of the UK&#39;s fastest-growing digital health brands.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll think end-to-end — from bidding and targeting strategy through to landing page experimentation, optimisation, and performance analysis. If you&#39;ve mastered paid search in regulated industries, thrive on seven-figure monthly budgets, and love turning complexity into measurable results, we want to meet you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the UK Google Search growth strategy, driving measurable performance across Performance Max, Search, Shopping, Display, YouTube, and Gmail&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage and optimise 7 figure monthly media budgets, working closely with Allocation &amp;amp; Performance Managers on budget allocation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead A/B and multivariate landing page testing, turning performance data into actionable insights&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with design, analytics, and engineering to improve CTR, CVR, and ROAS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion a culture of testing and optimisation, embedding experimentation into every stage of the funnel&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay ahead of platform changes — monitoring new Google features, policy updates, and compliance nuances within healthcare advertising&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor and report on performance using Google Analytics, Search Console, and Looker Studio, ensuring clarity and precision in results&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyse competitors and UK market trends to identify growth opportunities and develop high-performing bidding and targeting strategies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work cross-functionally with product, marketing, design, and the Growth Lead to ensure consistent messaging and execution of market-winning strategies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years in search or paid media, with deep hands-on experience managing Google campaigns&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expert knowledge of Google Ads, including advanced campaign types and automation features (e.g. Performance Max)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record planning, executing, and interpreting landing page experiments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly analytical mindset with strong attention to detail, able to form data-driven hypotheses, define success metrics, and communicate findings clearly to stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in regulated industries (e.g., healthcare, pharma, insurance) and comfort navigating compliance frameworks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in D2C, consumer, or subscription-based businesses — you understand how to optimise for acquisition, retention, and lifetime value&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of UK consumer behaviour and how to localise campaigns for tone, messaging, and search intent&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills, written and verbal; able to translate performance data into actionable recommendations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with healthcare-specific search compliance (e.g., medical claims, ad copy restrictions, prescription pathways) is highly desirable&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience scaling search in multi-market or global organisations, and comfort using first-party data to optimise creative and bidding strategies, is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why join Eucalyptus?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Eucalyptus is building a global digital healthcare platform designed to help people live longer, healthier lives through accessible, evidence-based care.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Alongside brands including Eucalyptus, Pilot, Kin, Software, and Compound, we&#39;re redefining preventive healthcare across multiple markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Makes Joining Eucalyptus Unique&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High-growth opportunity – We&#39;re scaling rapidly across new markets, conditions, and demographics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Meaningful impact – Your work will directly influence patient outcomes and business growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ownership and autonomy – You&#39;ll have the freedom to test bold ideas and shape the search growth strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Career acceleration – Work alongside high-performing teams in an ambitious, fast-moving environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mission-driven work – Help build one of the world&#39;s leading digital healthcare companies focused on preventive care and long-term health outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;At Eucalyptus, we value individuals from all backgrounds, experiences, and perspectives, and we embrace the unique qualities each person brings. When you apply, please let us know of any reasonable adjustments you may need during the interview process. We use AI-assisted tools across our business to help our teams work more efficiently, including within our recruitment process. These tools support our team — all hiring decisions are made by real people, and every application is reviewed by a member of our recruitment team.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;At Eucalyptus, we value individuals from all backgrounds, experiences, and perspectives, and we embrace the unique qualities each person brings. When you apply, please let us know of any reasonable adjustments you may need during the interview process. We use AI-assisted tools across our business to help our teams work more efficiently, including within our recruitment process. These tools support our team — all hiring decisions are made by real people, and every application is reviewed by a member of our recruitment team.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;Founded in 2020, unybrands is the next-generation brand accelerator platform built to acquire, integrate, and scale digital-first consumer brands. Headquartered in Miami, with offices in New York, London, Berlin, and Shenzhen, our 240+ team brings deep expertise across e-commerce, brand management, consumer retail, operational scaling, and M&amp;amp;A.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;Since inception, we have acquired 30+ brands across Pet Care, Personal Care, Home Care, Supplements, Baby &amp;amp; Juvenile, Garden &amp;amp; Outdoor, Sports &amp;amp; Fitness, and Home &amp;amp; Lifestyle — completing 20+ acquisitions and delivering 16 consecutive quarters of like-for-like organic growth post-integration.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;Our competitive advantage lies in a fully integrated operating system purpose-built to transform digital brands into omni-channel category leaders. Powered by a proprietary technology stack built on NetSuite ERP with 200+ data integrations, our platform enables brands to thrive across marketplaces, direct-to-consumer channels, and brick-and-mortar retail.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;We focus on acquiring digital-first brands within carefully selected verticals, then applying tailored value creation playbooks that drive growth through innovation, expansion, and automation. We believe the next generation of consumer brands will be built differently — and we&#39;re building the AI-enabled retail tech platform to help them consolidate and win.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Supply Planner to manage and optimize our inventory levels across multiple brands.&amp;nbsp;Your primary goal will be ensuring the right product is available at the right time while balancing supply&amp;nbsp;chain efficiency and working capital investment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;Optimize planning parameters such as safety stock, order quantities, and replenishment cycles to maintain availability and minimize excess inventory.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;Track and analyze key supply chain metrics, including supplier reliability, lead time accuracy, predicted lost sales and inventory efficiency, and provide the visibility for planning adjustments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;Develop reporting tools and models to provide visibility on supply chain performance, identifying trends and improvement opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;Drive efficiency by refining planning methodologies, reducing supply chain costs, and improving working capital utilization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work cross-functionally with brand managers, finance, and logistics teams to align supply plans&amp;nbsp;with business goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure seamless and timely execution of purchase orders, shipments, and inventory replenishments to maintain stock availability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure planning and stock allocation to different sales channels, in accordance to trading&amp;nbsp;seasons and other sales events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support strategic initiatives such as supplier negotiations, capacity planning, and supply network&amp;nbsp;optimization.&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;p1R_mc43&quot; class=&quot;markedContent&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A successful team member will have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;p1R_mc45&quot; class=&quot;markedContent&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;p1R_mc45&quot; class=&quot;markedContent&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;3+&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span&gt;years&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span&gt;of&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span&gt;experience&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span&gt;in&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span&gt;a&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span&gt;supply&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span&gt;chain&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span&gt;planning&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span&gt;role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;p1R_mc47&quot; class=&quot;markedContent&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;Ideal&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span&gt;previous&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span&gt;exposure&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span&gt;to&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span&gt;e-commerce&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;p1R_mc49&quot; class=&quot;markedContent&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;Experience&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span&gt;in&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span&gt;dealing&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span&gt;with&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span&gt;systems&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span&gt;and&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span&gt;technology&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span&gt;to&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span&gt;scale&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span&gt;planning&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span&gt;operations:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span&gt;ERP &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;p1R_mc50&quot; class=&quot;markedContent&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;knowledge,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span&gt;SQL,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span&gt;BI&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span&gt;software,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span&gt;etc.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;p1R_mc52&quot; class=&quot;markedContent&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;Strong&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span&gt;reporting&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span&gt;skills&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span&gt;for&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span&gt;a&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span&gt;broad&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span&gt;range&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span&gt;of&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span&gt;audiences:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span&gt;from&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span&gt;preparing&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span&gt;the&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span&gt;data&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span&gt;to&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span&gt;presenting &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;p1R_mc53&quot; class=&quot;markedContent&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;insights&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;p1R_mc55&quot; class=&quot;markedContent&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;Knowledge&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span&gt;of&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span&gt;different&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span&gt;supply&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span&gt;chain&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span&gt;network&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span&gt;configuration&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;role&quot;&gt;
&lt;section id=&quot;role&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;text&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW182919787 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW182919787 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;normaltextrun&quot; data-ccp-charstyle-defn=&quot;{&amp;quot;ObjectId&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;db2d2cc1-08b2-4ddd-a884-b285c3400554|43&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;ClassId&amp;quot;:1073872969,&amp;quot;Properties&amp;quot;:[469775450,&amp;quot;normaltextrun&amp;quot;,201340122,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,134233614,&amp;quot;true&amp;quot;,469778129,&amp;quot;normaltextrun&amp;quot;,335572020,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,469778324,&amp;quot;Default Paragraph Font&amp;quot;]}&quot;&gt;unybrands&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW182919787 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt; is an equal opportunity employer and considers all applicants for employment without any regard to race, skin color, religion, gender identity, sexual orientation, and age. Nor are applicants discriminated against based on disability or protected classes. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW182919787 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
