&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About The Company&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;GROPYUS is a technology-based construction company focused on building multi-story residential buildings. Thanks to its prefabricated building system with various design options, industrial offsite construction, and fully digitalized processes, the company manufactures aspirational, sustainable, and affordable homes using timber construction methods. GROPYUS is using scalable construction and manufacturing solutions to tap into a future market, boost Europe&#39;s strength in innovation, while also playing a substantial role in improving sustainability.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 1&quot;&gt;About the Role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134245418&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245529&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:280,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:120,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:269}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;As a Product Manager for our Production Platform you will drive digital solutions that connect manufacturing equipment, production systems, and operational data into a scalable and reliable production ecosystem.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:140,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:269}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;You will work with software engineers and manufacturing / automation experts to define products and services that support production control, validation and simulation services in the design and series operation phases of manufacturing as well as solutions for maintaining proper operational transparency. By translating factory needs into product solutions, you will help improve how manufacturing capabilities are integrated, monitored, and continuously optimized across our production environment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:140,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:269}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;ON-SITE COLLABORATION&amp;nbsp; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Regular on-site work at our Richen production plant is expected. You will work closely with software developers, automation engineers, industrial engineers, and production stakeholders to develop a deep understanding of the manufacturing environment, discover opportunities, validate solutions, and support successful product adoption.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:269}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 1&quot;&gt;What You&#39;ll Be Doing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134245418&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245529&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:280,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:120,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:269}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;Drive&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;end-to-end product development, from discovery through delivery and iteration with a focus on process&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;creation and improvement&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;scoping &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;manufacturing system integration, operational data availability&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;simulation of manufacturing processes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt; /&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt; production capabilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:140,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:269}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;Translate business needs into clear product roadmaps, and actionable requirements&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:140,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:269}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;Ensur&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;e&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt; alignment of&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt; product goals with business &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;objectives&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;, operational efficiency, and customer needs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:140,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:269}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
