&lt;p&gt;Principal data strategists at Thoughtworks are experienced consultants who work with clients to create winning data solutions that meet business goals. They play a pivotal role in developing modern data architecture approaches that directly address our clients&#39; key business objectives. Their responsibilities span in-depth reviews of current data and technology strategy, targeted data strategy, guiding clients to unlock the full potential of data, and providing high-level roadmaps.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role entails a mix of advisory responsibilities in data strategy and governance, coupled with a solid delivery-lead role and a breadth of data and AI ecosystem expertise.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a client-facing, builder&#39;s leadership role. You will start with a small, senior team and grow it through technical depth, delivery excellence and thought leadership, rather than inheriting a large organisation to manage. The role is based in Germany and requires regular travel to client sites, up to approximately 50% of your time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will collaborate closely with clients to understand their business ecosystem and goals, and co-create data and technology strategies aligned with their objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will help define a clear vision for the client enterprise to become data-driven and aligned with the overall business strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will consult on complex data programs, providing technical leadership and guidance as a data subject-matter expert.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will lead and interact with clients across various domains, addressing challenging problems, and collaborate with sales to turn them into viable solutions and winning proposals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will act as a translator between business, data and IT, and communicate data strategy to senior client stakeholders, including C-level.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will own the creation of end-to-end viable data solutions, keeping in mind long-term impacts and overseeing program inceptions for new product development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will be responsible for formulating data governance strategies addressing security, privacy and compliance requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will enable capability building in data strategy and governance, growing the next generation of data strategists.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will create differentiated assets in data strategy and governance to take to market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You lead through influence rather than headcount: growing capability and raising delivery standards inside the organisation, while building our presence in the market through thought leadership, ecosystem initiatives and client-facing points of view.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have extensive experience as a consultant, with a proven track record of creating data strategy and solutions that drive business value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have solid experience with data platforms and technologies, and can provide advisory and consultative guidance for clients and cross-delivery teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience engaging with C-level stakeholders to influence and enable the operationalization of an enterprise-wide data strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have demonstrated leadership abilities, with the capacity to lead technical teams and drive projects to successful completion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are flexible and adaptable across a variety of projects, leveraging technical expertise and leadership to maximise impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a track record of ensuring proper data governance policies, including data lineage, quality checks and classification.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience with AI and ML use cases and landscapes and can influence the build of the right solutions to harness insights from data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience building high-level solution frameworks, leveraging paradigms such as data-as-a-product and federated governance where needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have professional working proficiency in German (B2 minimum, C1 strongly preferred) and can build consensus with mostly technical stakeholders. Exceptional candidates with outstanding data and AI consulting credentials may be considered where German is not yet at this level.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Consulting and commercial track record&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have worked in a consultancy or professional-services environment within the last five years, driving data and AI engagements end to end (recent examples matter more than historical ones).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You can point to data and AI pursuits you helped win and shape within the last three to five years, including deals from around €3M upwards, and you can speak concretely to their commercial shape, trade-offs and delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have grown a practice, capability or go-to-market asset, for example a reusable accelerator taken to market, combining solutioning, sales and delivery with tangible business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You stay conversant with the technology and hands-on enough in at least one relevant area to earn technical credibility with client and delivery teams, while leading primarily on strategy and advisory.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You bring significant hands-on and leadership experience in data and AI (typically 10+ years) and, above all, the appetite to keep building: growing accounts, teams and capability rather than only overseeing them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Professional Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You understand the importance of stakeholder management and can easily liaise between clients and other key stakeholders, ensuring buy-in and gaining trust along the way.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are resilient in ambiguous situations and can adapt your role to approach challenges from multiple perspectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You don&#39;t shy away from risks or conflicts, instead you take them on and skillfully manage them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You coach, mentor and motivate others and aspire to influence teammates to take positive action and accountability for their work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You enjoy influencing others and always advocate for technical excellence while being open to change when needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cultivating strong partnerships comes naturally to you; you understand how relationship building brings new opportunities to our business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have professional working proficiency in German (B2 minimum, C1 strongly preferred) and can build consensus with mostly technical stakeholders. Exceptional candidates with outstanding data and AI consulting credentials may be considered where German is not yet at this level.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Other things to know&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Learning &amp;amp; Development&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;There is no one-size-fits-all career path at Thoughtworks: however you want to develop your career is entirely up to you. But we also balance autonomy with the strength of our cultivation culture. This means your career is supported by interactive tools, numerous development programs and teammates who want to help you grow. We see value in helping each other be our best and that extends to empowering our employees in their career journeys.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsible Use of AI in Recruitment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Thoughtworks, we use AI tools to support our recruitment team with administrative tasks such as drafting communications, scheduling interviews and writing job descriptions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Crucially, our AI tools do not screen, assess, rank or make hiring decisions. Every application is reviewed by our team and all selection decisions are made exclusively by our interviewers and hiring managers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are committed to fairness and responsible AI. We actively manage our AI systems by testing, monitoring for biased outcomes and implementing mitigation measures. We hold our third-party vendors to these same high standards through a rigorous governance process. For additional information, please see our full Thoughtworks AI Policy for Recruitment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Thoughtworks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Thoughtworks is a dynamic and inclusive community of bright and supportive colleagues who are revolutionizing tech. As a leading technology consultancy, we&#39;re pushing boundaries through our purposeful and impactful work. For 30+ years, we&#39;ve delivered extraordinary impact together with our clients by helping them solve complex business problems with technology as the differentiator. Bring your brilliant expertise and commitment for continuous learning to Thoughtworks. Together, let&#39;s be extraordinary.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.thoughtworks.com/careers/ai-policy-for-recruitment&quot;&gt;See here our AI policy.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h2&gt;Sell transformative AI solutions to some of the most innovative enterprises in EMEA.&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;351&quot; data-end=&quot;545&quot;&gt;Are you passionate about the transformative power of AI? Join Coveo and help bring cutting-edge AI solutions to leading enterprise organizations across the EMEA market.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;547&quot; data-end=&quot;806&quot;&gt;At Coveo, we build AI-powered solutions that deliver hyper-relevant and personalized digital experiences. Our platform combines enterprise AI and generative AI to help businesses drive profitability while creating meaningful customer and employee experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;813&quot; data-end=&quot;870&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;813&quot; data-end=&quot;870&quot;&gt;As our Senior Enterprise Account Executive, you will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify, engage, and develop relationships with enterprise clients across the EMEA region.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build strategic account plans focused on delivering measurable business outcomes for customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with alliances managers and partners to generate and expand business opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead complex enterprise sales cycles from initial engagement through negotiation and closing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop compelling business cases and proposals that clearly articulate the value of Coveo’s platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consistently achieve or exceed quarterly and annual sales targets while maintaining accurate pipeline reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2004&quot; data-end=&quot;2037&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2004&quot; data-end=&quot;2037&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Here is what will qualify you for the role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of experience managing complex enterprise software sales cycles, engaging stakeholders from business champions to C-level executives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to consistently exceed quota in a hunter-style sales environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience selling enterprise technology solutions to organizations in the Commerce or Service industries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong consultative and challenger sales approach, with the ability to communicate complex technology value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2004&quot; data-end=&quot;2037&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2004&quot; data-end=&quot;2037&quot;&gt;What will make you stand out:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience selling artificial intelligence or generative AI solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;MEDDPICC certification or experience applying the methodology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated success building strong partner relationships to accelerate enterprise sales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curiosity, creativity, and a collaborative mindset that helps drive innovative solutions for customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Do you think you can bring this role to life? Or add your own color?&lt;br&gt;You don’t need to check every single box; passion goes a long way and we appreciate that skillsets are transferable.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Send us your application, we want to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join the Coveolife!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We encourage all qualified candidates to apply regardless of, for example, age, gender, disability, gaps in CV, national or ethnic background.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This job description was written by humans, assisted by AI. We may leverage technology in our hiring process to help us see the person behind the resume.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Banyan Software is the best permanent home for software businesses that serve specialized industries, their employees, and their customers. With a buy-grow-and-hold-for-life approach and a permanent capital base, Banyan acquires and grows companies worldwide, honoring founder legacies and helping portfolio companies modernize through shared AI expertise and operational discipline. Founded in 2016, Banyan operates more than 120 portfolio companies across North and South America, Europe, and APAC, and has appeared on the Inc. 5000 list for six consecutive years. The Banyan Software Foundation, endowed with $100 million in Banyan stock, leverages technology to build a greener and more equitable world.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Banyan Software&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Banyan Software is the best permanent home for software businesses that serve specialized industries, their employees, and their customers. We are on a mission to acquire, build, and grow great companies worldwide, helping them modernize through shared AI expertise and operational discipline. The Banyan Software Foundation, endowed with $100 million in Banyan stock, leverages technology to build a greener and more equitable world. Banyan is Great Place to Work Certified, a five-time Inc. 5000 honoree, and a top 10 company on the Deloitte Technology Fast 500. Founded in 2016 and headquartered in Atlanta, Banyan operates more than 100 portfolio companies across North America, the UK, EU, and APAC.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About HMM Deutschland GmbH&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HMM Deutschland GmbH is a specialist healthcare workflow processor headquartered in NRW, Germany, serving major German statutory health insurers (GKV). The company manages high-volume claims processing and pharmaceutical billing workflows for leading GKV customers — providing mission-critical infrastructure for the German statutory health system with deeply embedded, long-term customer relationships.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Having recently joined the Banyan Software family, the business is entering an exciting new chapter — applying AI-driven process automation to strengthen operational excellence while deepening long-standing customer partnerships.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are hiring a Director of Customer Operations &amp;amp; Projects (m/w/d) to own the entire customer delivery layer of the business. This is a senior leadership role at the heart of operations: you will run the project management function, govern BPO and SLA operations across all service lines, and serve as the senior relationship owner for the company&#39;s most strategically important accounts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is central to the company&#39;s value creation plan under Banyan. You will lead the business through a consequential AI-driven operational transformation while protecting the customer trust and SLA performance that define its market position. You will report directly to the CEO, partner closely with the CPTO on technology delivery, and work with Banyan&#39;s DACH Operating Partner on strategic priorities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Own&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leadership &amp;amp; Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reset and professionalise the delivery function — establish clear standards, accountabilities, and operating rhythms across the customer operations and project management teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Organise the team around key customer programmes and strategic projects; ensure every initiative has clear ownership, milestones, and governance from day one&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build a high-performing, cohesive team: hire well, develop talent, set expectations clearly, and address underperformance directly and without delay&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create a culture of delivery discipline — where commitments are made carefully, tracked rigorously, and met consistently&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coach and develop the next layer of leadership within the PM and customer operations team, building capacity that does not depend on the Director as a bottleneck&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the team through significant operational change — AI-driven transformation, process redesign, and capability building — with clarity, transparency, and pace&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Project Management Function&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the project management methodology end-to-end: governance gates, risk and issue tracking, change control, templates, and lessons learned&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and develop the PM team; set quality standards and drive consistent delivery discipline across all active customer projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain a live portfolio view of all active projects — status, budget, risk, and milestones — reported to the CEO and Banyan monthly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the final internal escalation point for any project rated red or amber; bring structure and momentum where delivery is at risk&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with the CPTO to integrate AI and technology delivery projects into the customer governance framework&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive adoption and hygiene of the existing toolstack across the team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Account — Senior Relationship Ownership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the senior relationship owner for the company&#39;s largest and highest-priority customer accounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own account project plans: milestones, deliverables, resource allocation, change management, and acceptance criteria&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Chair programme steering committees; maintain live risk registers; escalate blockers to the CEO within 24 hours&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure contractual SLAs are met every month; manage any miss proactively, not reactively&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify expansion opportunities within key accounts: additional workflow coverage, module adoption, and AI-assisted process enhancements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Protect relationship continuity through the company&#39;s AI-driven transformation — no surprises, no disruption to service&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;BPO Operations &amp;amp; SLA Governance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own delivery SLAs across all workflow service lines; track KPIs including tickets per FTE, cost per case, time-to-resolution, first-time-right rate, and touchless processing rate&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage the operations team through an AI-driven headcount restructuring while maintaining throughput and quality throughout the transition&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Project-manage a major in-house billing capability transition, ensuring customer SLAs are uninterrupted throughout&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Produce a monthly SLA performance dashboard — RAG-rated, trend-based, corrective actions flagged — for the CEO and Banyan Operating Partner&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead quarterly service reviews with all major customers: own the agenda, the data, and the follow-up actions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer Satisfaction &amp;amp; Retention&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the customer satisfaction framework: NPS or equivalent, structured feedback loops, and a closed-loop process for acting on customer input&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Personally manage the company&#39;s most important customer relationships with regular check-ins, escalation ownership, and relationship health tracking&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor churn risk signals: SLA trends, open tickets, stakeholder changes, and contract renewal timelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent the customer voice internally — in roadmap discussions, resource prioritisation, and transformation sequencing decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications for Success&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Direct experience in healthcare IT, GKV/SGB workflow processing, pharmaceutical billing, or a similarly regulated German-speaking healthcare services environment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record owning large, complex customer-facing programmes — multi-year, multi-stakeholder, with hard SLA accountability; experience running or building a PMO or PM team is a strong advantage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background managing or transforming high-volume BPO or managed services operations — comfortable with throughput economics: tickets/FTE, cost-per-case, and SLA governance at scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record owning senior customer relationships at Director or Head of Operations level, including escalation management and account recovery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to build, lead, and develop high-performing operational teams through periods of significant change&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Business fluent in both German and English — required for customer communication, team leadership, and Banyan internal reporting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading teams through AI-driven or technology-led operational transformation without eroding customer trust or SLA performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Germany-based with willingness to work regularly from our NRW office and travel to customer sites; NRW region strongly preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Base salary: €120,000 – €150,000 per annum, depending on experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Annual performance bonus: up to 20–25% of base salary, tied to account delivery, BPO SLA attainment, and AI-driven process improvement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;30 days annual leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company pension (bAV) with employer contribution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible hybrid working — NRW office and customer site presence required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relocation support available for candidates outside the NRW/DACH region&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity, Inclusion &amp;amp; Equal Employment Opportunity at Banyan&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Banyan affirms that inequality is detrimental to our Teams, associates, our Operating Companies, and the communities we serve. Our goal is to impact lasting change through our actions. Together, we unite for equality and equity. Banyan is committed to equal employment opportunities regardless of any protected characteristic, including race, color, genetic information, creed, national origin, religion, sex, affectional or sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, lawful alien status, ancestry, age, marital status, or protected veteran status and will not discriminate against anyone on the basis of a disability. We support an inclusive workplace where associates excel based on personal merit, qualifications, experience, ability, and job performance.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HMM Deutschland GmbH · A Banyan Software Company · NRW, Germany · banyansoftware.com&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Diversity, Equity, Inclusion &amp;amp; Equal Employment Opportunity at Banyan: Banyan affirms that inequality is detrimental to our Global Teams, associates, our Operating Companies, and the communities we serve. As a collective, our goal is to impact lasting change through our actions. Together, we unite for equality and equity. Banyan is committed to equal employment opportunities regardless of any protected characteristic, including race, color, genetic information, creed, national origin, religion, sex, affectional or sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, lawful alien status, ancestry, age, marital status, or protected veteran status and will not discriminate against anyone on the basis of a disability. We support an inclusive workplace where associates excel based on personal merit, qualifications, experience, ability, and job performance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please Note&lt;/strong&gt;: Banyan Software does not accept unsolicited resumes or applications submitted via email, LinkedIn, or other direct channels. All candidates must apply through our official Careers site to be considered for employment. Applications submitted outside of our applicant tracking system will not be reviewed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Recruitment Notice&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Banyan Software may use artificial intelligence (AI) tools to assist in screening and/or assessing applicants during the recruitment process. All hiring decisions are made by our team. Personal information submitted through your application will be collected and used for recruitment purposes in accordance with applicable privacy laws. Contact us at any time with questions about our process or to request accommodation.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Beware of Recruitment Scams&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have been made aware of individuals fraudulently posing as members of our Talent Acquisition team and extending fake job offers. These scams may involve requests for personal information or payment for equipment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Protect yourself by following these steps:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Verify that all communications from our recruiting team come from an ----- email address.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Remember, employers will &lt;strong&gt;never&lt;/strong&gt; request payment or banking information during the hiring process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;If you receive a suspicious message, &lt;strong&gt;do not respond&lt;/strong&gt; — instead, forward it to &lt;a ---------- and/or report it to the platform where you received it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your safety and security are important to us. Thank you for staying vigilant.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;fortidlp-input-element-parent&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About The Company&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;GROPYUS is a technology-based construction company focused on building multi-story residential buildings. Thanks to its prefabricated building system with various design options, industrial offsite construction, and fully digitalized processes, the company manufactures aspirational, sustainable, and affordable homes using timber construction methods. GROPYUS is using scalable construction and manufacturing solutions to tap into a future market, boost Europe&#39;s strength in innovation, while also playing a substantial role in improving sustainability.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;About the Role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be part of a highly collaborative product team working at the core of our manufacturing facility, transforming digital models into physical elements at scale. Product Teams at GROPYUS own what they build, including the underlying infrastructure, build pipelines, automated testing, release and rollout management, monitoring, and support. You will be trusted to solve problems efficiently and effectively, building on top of a solid architecture and operational foundation, and will be encouraged to seek out under-attended topics and assume responsibility for them both within your product area and across product areas.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Staff Engineer, you have an impact across multiple teams within your product area. Staff Engineers effectively collaborate with other Staff Engineers and foster a culture of regular exchange and cooperation. Their ability to communicate effectively and take initiative ensures that they not only contribute to the technical success of projects, but also help drive overall growth and innovation within the company by sharing both best practices and failures, and learning from them. With your focus on and experience in SRE / operating large systems, you will drive and spearhead operational excellence within your product area.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you&#39;ll be doing&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Staff Engineer (f/m/d) on the Production Platform team, you will be responsible for:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Designing and building the software at the core of our manufacturing and owning the integrations that connect it to physical machines and vendor systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leading technical initiatives that ensure software systems are reliable, maintainable, and operationally sound, especially in logistics- and manufacturing-heavy domains&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working in a hybrid infrastructure environment (cloud and on-prem), managing complex software deployments at scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bringing a Site Reliability Engineering (SRE) mindset to monitor, maintain, and improve software uptime, including reliable updates, latency, and efficiency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Acting as a bridge between digital product delivery and physical logistics and manufacturing systems, including assessing vendors for integration fitness, owning buy-vs-build decisions, and negotiating API changes with machine and equipment vendors toward usable, maintainable interfaces&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentoring engineers across multiple teams and improving system-wide architecture, a maintainable and sound codebase, and operational excellence incl. incident handling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Helping define, monitor, and evolve SLAs/SLOs as well as other important KPIs like e.g. OEE for critical systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you bring&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are an experienced software engineer with a strong background in Site Reliability Engineering or operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You possess practical experience in all key areas of modern software development, including infrastructure, observability, testing, deployment pipelines incl. quality assurance, and scaling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ve operated and supported large-scale software systems in cloud and non-cloud environments (on-premise)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ve worked in companies with strong operational cultures, ideally in logistics or manufacturing — understanding the commercial impact of system downtime&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;re comfortable owning integrations with external systems, and can shape and negotiate vendor or machine APIs toward maintainable, scalable interfaces rather than working around whatever you&#39;re handed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience mentoring and guiding engineers at various levels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are proficient with most of the following technologies:
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Kotlin / SpringBoot&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Kubernetes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Linux&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;PostgreSQL&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;TimeFold / Camunda / BPMN / Optimization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Python / Bash is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;OPC-UA / PLC / SPS is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You bring Cloud Operations experience
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Azure is a bonus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;re familiar with monitoring and alerting practices for production systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with defining and working with SLAs/SLOs is a bonus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are willing to travel within Germany for in-person team events as well as visiting our manufacturing location&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 18pt;&quot;&gt;What we offer&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Be part of something big:&lt;/em&gt;&amp;nbsp;You’re here to make a change? Come on board. At GROPYUS, we are on a mission to re-think an entire industry. Join us in reinventing construction and sustainable, affordable living.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;It’s on you:&lt;/em&gt;&amp;nbsp;We offer a tremendous amount of ownership and room to make a mark - at all our organization levels. Find your solutions, drive and test them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Focus on results:&lt;/em&gt;&amp;nbsp;You choose if you work from home, a park, or the office. Whether you start your day early, after your run, or pick up on work when your kids are in bed. What counts is your contribution and delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Bring your uniqueness to the team&lt;/em&gt;:&amp;nbsp;Innovation requires diversity of thought. Diversity in background, experience and thinking is crucial to create the best product for everyone. We actively seek diversity and strive to unlock each other’s full potential. We are very proud that people from all industries and all walks of life are joining our company – in addition to core areas such as construction, engineering, and start-ups, from stock-listed companies from across automotive e-Commerce, digital, sporting goods, and more. You will work in international teams with passionate colleagues. Inspire and be inspired.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Be an owner:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;Participate in the success of GROPYUS through stock options.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Join us on our mission to design buildings as continuously evolving products to create the most exciting and affordable experience for all. We build for people and conserve the resources of our planet.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We can&#39;t wait to get to know you.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;For more information, visit our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://gropyus.com/&quot;&gt;website&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About The Company&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;GROPYUS is a technology-based construction company focused on building multi-story residential buildings. Thanks to its prefabricated building system with various design options, industrial offsite construction, and fully digitalized processes, the company manufactures aspirational, sustainable, and affordable homes using timber construction methods. GROPYUS is using scalable construction and manufacturing solutions to tap into a future market, boost Europe&#39;s strength in innovation, while also playing a substantial role in improving sustainability.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;job&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;As a Software Engineer (f/m/d), you will be part of a highly collaborative product vertical working at the cutting-edge of a complex, evolving domain.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We build cross-collaborative and diverse teams that focus on products and are not tethered by ancient legacy systems or reporting structures. In this role you’ll help us design, build and maintain our Kotlin services and React applications. You’ll be working on a git-like version control system to allow architects and structural engineers to manage system rules and other components of GROPYUS’s Building Systems.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We live proactive, agile, and test-driven development and value automation not just in CI/CD but in every aspect of work. GROPYUS is the right home for you if you want to build products that profoundly impact people’s lives, if you value sustainability and take ownership.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
