&lt;h3 class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-section-id=&quot;lq4psh&quot; data-start=&quot;84&quot; data-end=&quot;155&quot;&gt;Build the data foundation behind AutoScout24’s commercial decisions.&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;157&quot; data-end=&quot;341&quot;&gt;As a Senior Sales Analyst in our Global Sales Analytics team, you will build and own the analytical data products that power Sales and Revenue Analytics across all AutoScout24 markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;343&quot; data-end=&quot;605&quot;&gt;This is a hands-on technical analytics role, working with complex commercial data across customers, contracts, products, pricing and revenue. The focus is on designing scalable data models, pipelines and reporting layers that provide trusted KPIs across markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;607&quot; data-end=&quot;737&quot;&gt;Close collaboration with leaders across functions will ensure that business needs are translated into robust analytical solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;wtadq0&quot; data-start=&quot;739&quot; data-end=&quot;765&quot;&gt;Why this role is unique&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;767&quot; data-end=&quot;1305&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;qek4ou&quot; data-start=&quot;767&quot; data-end=&quot;852&quot;&gt;End-to-end ownership of business-critical Sales and Revenue Analytics data products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1leyjcd&quot; data-start=&quot;853&quot; data-end=&quot;948&quot;&gt;Direct impact on commercial decisions across AutoScout24 markets, products and pricing models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1r2uvho&quot; data-start=&quot;949&quot; data-end=&quot;1040&quot;&gt;Complex technical challenges across customer, contract, product, pricing and revenue data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;hc8fqj&quot; data-start=&quot;1041&quot; data-end=&quot;1130&quot;&gt;Opportunity to shape reliable KPI logic, scalable data models and reporting foundations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;b72bz0&quot; data-start=&quot;1131&quot; data-end=&quot;1196&quot;&gt;Close partnership with both technical and business stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;u21ocs&quot; data-start=&quot;1197&quot; data-end=&quot;1305&quot;&gt;Exposure to major business changes, including CRM transformations, pricing initiatives and market launches&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;1tw9tfi&quot; data-start=&quot;1307&quot; data-end=&quot;1324&quot;&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1326&quot; data-end=&quot;2004&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1dlko5y&quot; data-start=&quot;1326&quot; data-end=&quot;1469&quot;&gt;Own business-critical Sales and Revenue Analytics data products end-to-end – from source data and transformations to reporting and validation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;y7pnkh&quot; data-start=&quot;1470&quot; data-end=&quot;1556&quot;&gt;Design, build and maintain scalable data models, reporting layers and data pipelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;p5oddn&quot; data-start=&quot;1557&quot; data-end=&quot;1644&quot;&gt;Write and optimise complex SQL and use Python for automation and analytical workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1l4bupl&quot; data-start=&quot;1645&quot; data-end=&quot;1753&quot;&gt;Troubleshoot pipeline failures, data inconsistencies and complex edge cases across multiple source systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;48gmhl&quot; data-start=&quot;1754&quot; data-end=&quot;1824&quot;&gt;Build reliable KPI logic across markets, products and pricing models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;fr3di9&quot; data-start=&quot;1825&quot; data-end=&quot;1926&quot;&gt;Support major business changes such as CRM transformations, pricing initiatives and market launches&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;78o1mn&quot; data-start=&quot;1927&quot; data-end=&quot;2004&quot;&gt;Use AI-assisted workflows to accelerate coding, debugging and documentation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;m0kazp&quot; data-start=&quot;2006&quot; data-end=&quot;2026&quot;&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;2028&quot; data-end=&quot;2863&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;suktr0&quot; data-start=&quot;2028&quot; data-end=&quot;2163&quot;&gt;6+ years of relevant experience in Data Analytics, Analytics Engineering, Business Intelligence or a similar technical analytics role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1dqvgy8&quot; data-start=&quot;2164&quot; data-end=&quot;2253&quot;&gt;Advanced SQL skills and strong hands-on experience working with complex production data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;118zex5&quot; data-start=&quot;2254&quot; data-end=&quot;2309&quot;&gt;Good Python skills for data processing and automation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;ji37d2&quot; data-start=&quot;2310&quot; data-end=&quot;2444&quot;&gt;Hands-on experience building and maintaining data pipelines and workflow orchestration, ideally with Airflow or similar technologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1v9dtqf&quot; data-start=&quot;2445&quot; data-end=&quot;2541&quot;&gt;Strong knowledge of data modelling, transformations, data quality and analytical data products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;im03eo&quot; data-start=&quot;2542&quot; data-end=&quot;2681&quot;&gt;Experience with modern cloud data platforms and BI tools such as AWS, Snowflake, Databricks, dbt, QuickSight, Tableau, Power BI or Looker&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;19qe4sy&quot; data-start=&quot;2682&quot; data-end=&quot;2799&quot;&gt;Strong business curiosity and the ability to translate Sales and Revenue questions into robust analytical solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1yyu0f&quot; data-start=&quot;2800&quot; data-end=&quot;2863&quot;&gt;Confidence working across technical and business stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;el9f7v&quot; data-start=&quot;2865&quot; data-end=&quot;2887&quot;&gt;What sets you apart&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;2889&quot; data-end=&quot;3392&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1ifj444&quot; data-start=&quot;2889&quot; data-end=&quot;3079&quot;&gt;A genuine interest in working close to the data – not only building dashboards, but understanding data sources, transformations, differing numbers and the reliability of solutions at scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;ktjvu9&quot; data-start=&quot;3080&quot; data-end=&quot;3176&quot;&gt;An engineering mindset combined with analytical curiosity and a high standard for data quality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1tu00v2&quot; data-start=&quot;3177&quot; data-end=&quot;3263&quot;&gt;Ownership and confidence in resolving issues when pipelines, data or processes break&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1ty6pkg&quot; data-start=&quot;3264&quot; data-end=&quot;3392&quot;&gt;A desire to pair technical excellence with visible commercial impact, helping AutoScout24 make better decisions across markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;3h2eeo&quot; data-start=&quot;3394&quot; data-end=&quot;3416&quot;&gt;A culture of growth&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3418&quot; data-end=&quot;3744&quot;&gt;With over 50 nationalities represented, we’re proud to welcome people of all backgrounds to our growing community, and we’re always finding new ways to help people feel welcomed and included. Here, you’ll have the tools, training and support you need to work in a way that suits you, learn new skills and reach your potential.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3746&quot; data-end=&quot;3825&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot; data-is-only-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;For a career where you can drive our business and shape your future, apply now.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/section&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Location&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;: &lt;/em&gt;Come and join us either in Barcelona, Berlin or Hamburg!&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Freenow by Lyft empowers smarter mobility decisions helping people to move freely and cities to thrive.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a senior CRM Manager to join our diverse and driven team. In this role, you’ll play a key part in achieving ambitious growth targets by engaging and retaining our global user base through impactful, data-driven CRM strategies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;YOUR DAILY ADVENTURES WILL INCLUDE:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;As part of the central CRM team, you will: maximise customer value by defining and implementing lifecycle strategies that activate, engage and retain users across our 9 markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own end-to-end automation creation process, from ideation to execution, across multiple channels (email, push notifications, in-app, SMS…)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advise and coach more junior team members on best in class CRM for global and local initiatives, ensuring the right message reaches the right user at the right time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Optimise performance using behavioural data, designing and analysing A/B tests, and reduce friction in the customer journey&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead cross-functional projects, such as dashboard creation, lifecycle segmentation, process optimisation, and experimentation frameworks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage and optimise CRM automations, aligning communications and themes with lifecycle stages and business priorities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify business opportunities and bring them to life together with Marketing, Product, local teams and North American counterparts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;TO BE SUCCESSFUL IN THIS ROLE:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience in CRM, lifecycle marketing, or customer engagement – ideally at a regional or global level&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with CRM platforms (experience with Braze is a plus)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong project management and stakeholder management skills, with the ability to influence across teams, markets, levels and time zones&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to effectively prioritise and manage a diverse set of initiatives in a fast-paced environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A data-driven mindset, using both quantitative and qualitative insights to inform decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills in English (other European languages are a plus)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
